up.\\r\\n\\r\\nLocal cloud development makes this easier by simulating the cloud app envir=\\r\\nonment on a container that=E2=80=99s easier to snapshot and reproduce.\\r\\n\\r\\nLocalStack's Snapshot feature saves your environment state automatically or=\\r\\n on demand, with free cloud storage included so you can:\\r\\n\\r\\n- Resume exactly where you left off\\r\\n- Reproduce a bug for a teammate\\r\\n- Share environment state across your team\\r\\n\\r\\nSee how it works =E2=86=92\\r\\n\\r\\nCheck It Out\\r\\n(https://docs.localstack.cloud/aws/developer-tools/snapshots/?utm_source=3D=\\r\\nemail1&utm_medium=3Dnurture&utm_campaign=3Dlead_nurture&_hsenc=3Dp2ANqtz-8H=\\r\\nuydEq22BByDK55sYO2-3T_oJ1UbEWSFD_FAsP2uRxDF6mHKxDOxtsloHftakxuQQvb6-EsxQu4r=\\r\\n2hXbZrYr5xB-xCHw5PWvnWHCbgMJG035bqtQ&_hsmi=3D141958089 )\\r\\n\\r\\nLearn to scale across your team =E2=86=92\\r\\n\\r\\nTalk to Sales\\r\\n(https://www.localstack.cloud/demo?utm_source=3Demail1&utm_medium=3Dnurture=\\r\\n&utm_campaign=3Dlead_nurture&_hsenc=3Dp2ANqtz-8HuydEq22BByDK55sYO2-3T_oJ1Ub=\\r\\nEWSFD_FAsP2uRxDF6mHKxDOxtsloHftakxuQQvb6-EsxQu4r2hXbZrYr5xB-xCHw5PWvnWHCbgM=\\r\\nJG035bqtQ&_hsmi=3D141958089 )\\r\\n\\r\\nBest\\r\\n\\r\\nLocalStack Team\\r\\n\\r\\nYour email is stored in accordance with our privacy policy, and not include=\\r\\nd in marketing purposes without your explicit consent.\\r\\n\\r\\nLocalStack GmbH, Uetlibergstrasse 95, Zurich, Zurich 8045, Switzerland\\r\\n\\r\\nUnsubscribe (https://hs-26596507.s.hubspotemail-eu1.net/hs/preferences-cent=\\r\\ner/en/direct?data=3DW2nVjwf3Y2wWMW47N5tW2zJGp5W1QxKBZ4mbnZ_W3Y2Yn92vNL99W2C=\\r\\nGN1F3ZNm3mW1LDG8T3BLFnQW30mPrD1SrTlPW3SLVc24mmzDkW41GxRY2sC0-fW3bqqlk4t4qcr=\\r\\nW4ptbtt3M65KCW3dsmlq23fz27W1QCWk03JXvrPW2PTQHH2B0GxLW1Sc1vD3ZMsZ5W1Zqx834hf=\\r\\ngnhW2WH6CB4p9QxrW2CSdBs4rHFYRW22TJvk1N7fBBW2WHD_C32gCn7W4hCRX_2YrVDgW2t3NBc=\\r\\n2KZlj0W4fJ8Rw2HJSbbW36lG2J3DT__kW2p5nTK38bF27W1Zm-d53ZFML0W38f1F32-s5VQW3_S=\\r\\nmDL4rxhxxW1Svqhg2145bMW4fQ2Fg4myWgNW24_FxQ2W