\\r\\nDate: Mon, 3 Aug 2026 14:41:37 -0400\\r\\nFrom: Fireworks AI <product@fireworks.ai>\\r\\nReply-To: marketing@fireworks.ai\\r\\nTo: iltonwaniawski88@tempmailcf.dpdns.org\\r\\nMessage-ID: <1785775272421.e0e50d6c-e882-4ad4-ae5d-f970f44f325b@bf08.na2.hubspotemail.net>\\r\\nSubject: Last Chance to Register: Kimi K3 on Fireworks tomorrow at 10AM PT\\r\\nMIME-Version: 1.0\\r\\nContent-Type: multipart/alternative; \\r\\n\\tboundary=\\\"----=_Part_19966_597731321.1785775278000\\\"\\r\\nX-Report-Abuse-To: abuse@hubspot.com (see\\r\\n https://policy.hubspot.com/abuse-complaints)\\r\\nList-Unsubscribe-Post: List-Unsubscribe=One-Click\\r\\nFeedback-ID: ae0lywh:aiuuju3:aidf:HubSpot\\r\\n\\r\\n------=_Part_19966_597731321.1785775278000\\r\\nContent-Type: text/plain; charset=utf-8\\r\\nContent-Transfer-Encoding: quoted-printable\\r\\n\\r\\nDiscover Kimi K3's full capabilities and how to customize it to your worklo=\\r\\nads with James and Sinan from Fireworks.\\r\\n\\r\\nHi Ankit,\\r\\n\\r\\nUntil very recently, the best AI models were the ones you could only rent. =\\r\\nGLM 5.2 last month and now Kimi K3 this week have changed that.\\r\\n\\r\\nAs of Monday morning, Kimi K3 is live and fast on Fireworks. It is a massiv=\\r\\ne 2.8-trillion-parameter, open-weights model with native vision and a 1M-to=\\r\\nken context window. It goes toe-to-toe with the top closed frontier models =\\r\\non coding, agentic, and reasoning tasks, at a fraction of the cost. Yes, th=\\r\\ne benchmarks are strong. But the biggest difference is that you can run it =\\r\\nand train it on Fireworks Serverless.\\r\\n\\r\\nOn August 4 at 10:00 AM PDT, join James Reed and Sinan Ozdemir as they walk=\\r\\n through a live demo of how to do that on Fireworks.\\r\\n\\r\\nRSVP for Webinar\\r\\n(https://d5bPYQ04.na2.hubspotlinks.com/Ctc/ZX+113/d5bPYQ04/VX4Kwm3-VNXMW7NF=\\r\\npzk46TV7RW3kyKQV5Sgkd5N8mSy3W5n4LbW50kH_H6lZ3nVW19s0wG6X6W5-W5KyFsF80d_bYW5=\\r\\n62TPR3P6hkYW6TFgt55txXCkW17Gq236SmmYWW1ydphj1Fl7FhW2lS3345DQTCKMS6bR0Qjv_0N=\\r\\n7GhxmftT3jXW4hnFYH2Nx8QGW8VPGsV8PZpx0W6j53pT783dPzW3ZMzdN3w77p0W8Yc_GL2kyk5=\\r\\nRW3QBzWx7d3DGdW1mTc5x8y353QW2v4g9b3gfRMXW7CLHzr5VwjDwW6lCSJY5m9CTKW56nwbc8q=\\r\\nhj5vW1m6Pcv4H8S-YW1g3Lzm6vw1gnN55rdY7PDbbyN3jJJgZ_7SPsVwHS-h1hBzs_N3q75qZR7=\\r\\nGnWW6GQrX59lxQczW4gRvwC2fmh9kW1D_Tb26_P2p0W9h86dw418msyW5s7P_r4GsT15W556Zb9=\\r\\n5MlQFYf254Y0804 )\\r\\n\\r\\nTopics we'll cover\\r\\n\\r\\n- Why K3 changed the open model landscape: what it is, where it lands again=\\r\\nst other frontier models, and why an open model at this scale shifts the ca=\\r\\nlculus for what you build and where you run it.\\r\\n- How to start using K3 today: it went live on Fireworks Day 0, US-hosted, =\\r\\nwith zero-data-retention options and no GPUs to manage. We'll walk through =\\r\\nserverless pay-by-token access and the paths from \\\"curious\\\" to \\\"in producti=\\r\\non.\\\"\\r\\n- How to use our new serverless training: live, runnable examples of post-t=\\r\\nraining an agent on top of K3 with the Fireworks Training API. Full code ex=\\r\\namples on GitHub.\\r\\n- Open Q&A: ask us anything about K3, Fireworks, fine-tuning, or AI in gene=\\r\\nral.\\r\\n\\r\\nAbout the speakers\\r\\n\\r\\nSinan Ozdemir (https://d5bPYQ04.na2.hubspotlinks.com/Ctc/ZX+113/d5bPYQ04/VX=\\r\\n4Kwm3-VNXMW7NFpzk46TV7RW3kyKQV5Sgkd5N8mSy5-3pyd0W95jsWP6lZ3nKW1TRXd91x301xV=\\r\\nrwX9P6y4m2JW5zY-KN7MrGWjN92t076dgvwBW8fX1St3ctL0YW22RqbS1tZ_pFW4B7w0S3dNSHn=\\r\\nW6Q05cJ6Ch7T-V2l8Ym2PK3f6V8ljPb3QH10YVXMDYr6CGJzrN32h0mwKKzpdW6KlFkQ7H-mGXN=\\r\\n690mYlMvy9hN6VMC4dV88nzW7Gfrq286grCBW5cxL5z8D-f1sW6QvMXT6fJzRcW43w7kM4fzYg2=\\r\\nVbhP9Q1PtX93W6dMTXP7q_zxRN7lCxx9V8xlnM1nB5GDwdX7W91NcSx5tzmW9W3PYgZP6TxdRbV=\\r\\nVmcPy4wbFsqN11k4vRYCn-yVpgkrW97pY3TW6XJp5F5gnw5WW1RgWjF8Lmd8Yf1Dcfp604 )\\r\\n\\r\\nHead of AI Developer Education at Fireworks\\r\\n\\r\\nJames Reed (https://d5bPYQ04.na2.hubspotlinks.com/Ctc/ZX+113/d5bPYQ04/VX4Kw=\\r\\nm3-VNXMW7NFpzk46TV7RW3kyKQV5Sgkd5N8mSy5-3pyd0W95jsWP6lZ3nKW4VKVSL3mx5clW5