f]-->\\r\\n    <!--[if (mso)|(IE)]>\\r\\n  <td valign=3D\\\"top\\\" style=3D\\\"width:600px;\\\">\\r\\n<![endif]-->\\r\\n<!--[if gte mso 9]>\\r\\n  <table role=3D\\\"presentation\\\" width=3D\\\"600\\\" cellpadding=3D\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\r\\n=3D\\\"0\\\" style=3D\\\"width:600px\\\">\\r\\n<![endif]-->\\r\\n<div id=3D\\\"column-1766040127722-0\\\" class=3D\\\"hse-column hse-size-12\\\">\\r\\n    <table role=3D\\\"presentation\\\" cellpadding=3D\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=3D\\\"0\\\" width=\\r\\n=3D\\\"100%\\\" class=3D\\\"\\\" style=3D\\\"\\\"><tbody><tr><td class=3D\\\"hs_padded\\\" style=3D=\\r\\n\\\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:15px; color:#23496d; word-break:b=\\r\\nreak-word; padding:35px\\\"><div id=3D\\\"hs_cos_wrapper_module_17660401277225\\\" c=\\r\\nlass=3D\\\"hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_module\\\" st=\\r\\nyle=3D\\\"color: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit;\\\" data-hs-c=\\r\\nos-general-type=3D\\\"widget\\\" data-hs-cos-type=3D\\\"module\\\"><div id=3D\\\"hs_cos_wr=\\r\\napper_module_17660401277225_\\\" class=3D\\\"hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget=\\r\\n hs_cos_wrapper_type_rich_text\\\" style=3D\\\"color: inherit; font-size: inherit=\\r\\n; line-height: inherit;\\\" data-hs-cos-general-type=3D\\\"widget\\\" data-hs-cos-ty=\\r\\npe=3D\\\"rich_text\\\"><p style=3D\\\"font-size:14px; line-height:175%\\\"><span style=\\r\\n=3D\\\"color: #000000;\\\">Hi Ankit,</span></p>\\r\\n<p style=3D\\\"font-size:14px; line-height:175%\\\"><span style=3D\\\"color: #000000=\\r\\n;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\\r\\n<p style=3D\\\"color:#23496d; background-color:#ffffff; line-height:175%; font=\\r\\n-size:14px\\\" bgcolor=3D\\\"#ffffff\\\"><span style=3D\\\"color: #000000; font-size: 1=\\r\\n5px;\\\">Until very recently, the best AI models were the ones you could only =\\r\\nrent. GLM 5.2 last month and now Kimi K3 this week have changed that.</span=\\r\\n></p>\\r\\n<p style=3D\\\"color:#23496d; background-color:#ffffff; line-height:175%; font=\\r\\n-size:14px\\\" bgcolor=3D\\\"#ffffff\\\"><span style=3D\\\"color: #000000; font-size: 1=\\r\\n5px;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\\r\\n<p style=3D\\\"color:#23496d; background-color:#ffffff; line-height:175%; font=\\r\\n-size:14px\\\" bgcolor=3D\\\"#ffffff\\\"><span style=3D\\\"color: #000000; font-size: 1=\\r\\n5px;\\\">As of Monday morning, Kimi K3 is live and fast on Fireworks. It is a =\\r\\nmassive 2.8-trillion-parameter, open-weights model with native vision and a=\\r\\n 1M-token context window. It goes toe-to-toe with the top closed frontier m=\\r\\nodels on coding, agentic, and reasoning tasks, at a fraction of the cost. Y=\\r\\nes, the benchmarks are strong. But the biggest difference is that you can r=\\r\\nun it and train it on Fireworks Serverless.</span></p>\\r\\n<p style=3D\\\"color:#23496d; background-color:#ffffff; line-height:175%; font=\\r\\n-size:14px\\\" bgcolor=3D\\\"#ffffff\\\"><span style=3D\\\"color: #000000; font-size: 1=\\r\\n5px;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\\r\\n<p style=3D\\\"color:#23496d; background-color:#ffffff; line-height:175%; font=\\r\\n-size:14px\\\" bgcolor=3D\\\"#ffffff\\\"><span style=3D\\\"color: #000000; font-size: 1=\\r\\n5px;\\\">On <strong>August 4 at 10:00 AM PDT</strong>, join James Reed and Sin=\\r\\nan Ozdemir as they walk through a live demo of how to do that on Fireworks.=\\r\\n</span></p></div></div></td></tr></tbody></table>\\r\\n  <table role=3D\\\"presentation\\\" cellpadding=3D\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=3D\\\"0\\\" width=3D=\\r\\n\\\"100%\\\" class=3D\\\"\\\" style=3D\\\"\\\"><tbody><tr><td class=3D\\\"hs_padded\\\" style=3D\\\"fo=\\r\\nnt-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:15px; color:#23496d; word-break:brea=\\r\\nk-word; padding:10px 20px\\\"><div id=3D\\\"hs_cos_wrapper_module_17678204738102\\\"=\\r\\n class=3D\\\"hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_module\\\" =\\r\\nstyle=3D\\\"color: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit;\\\" data-hs=\\r\\n-cos-general-type=3D\\\"wid