dding:10px 20px 10px 35px\\\"><div id=3D\\\"hs_cos_wrapper_module_17853=\\r\\n581892061\\\" class=3D\\\"hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_typ=\\r\\ne_module\\\" style=3D\\\"color: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit=\\r\\n;\\\" data-hs-cos-general-type=3D\\\"widget\\\" data-hs-cos-type=3D\\\"module\\\"><div id=\\r\\n=3D\\\"hs_cos_wrapper_module_17853581892061_\\\" class=3D\\\"hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_w=\\r\\nrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_rich_text\\\" style=3D\\\"color: inherit; font-=\\r\\nsize: inherit; line-height: inherit;\\\" data-hs-cos-general-type=3D\\\"widget\\\" d=\\r\\nata-hs-cos-type=3D\\\"rich_text\\\"><p style=3D\\\"font-weight:bold; font-size:18px;=\\r\\n line-height:103%\\\"><span style=3D\\\"color: #000000;\\\">Topics we'll cover<br><b=\\r\\nr></span></p>\\r\\n<ul style=3D\\\"font-size:13px; line-height:175%\\\">\\r\\n<li><span style=3D\\\"color: #000000; font-size: 15px;\\\"><strong>Why K3 changed=\\r\\n the open model landscape</strong>: what it is, where it lands against othe=\\r\\nr frontier models, and why an open model at this scale shifts the calculus =\\r\\nfor what you build and where you run it.</span></li>\\r\\n<li><span style=3D\\\"color: #000000; font-size: 15px;\\\"><strong>How to start u=\\r\\nsing K3 today</strong>: it went live on Fireworks Day 0, US-hosted, with ze=\\r\\nro-data-retention options and no GPUs to manage. We'll walk through serverl=\\r\\ness pay-by-token access and the paths from \\\"curious\\\" to \\\"in production.\\\"</s=\\r\\npan></li>\\r\\n<li><span style=3D\\\"color: #000000; font-size: 15px;\\\"><strong>How to use our=\\r\\n&nbsp;new serverless training</strong>: live, runnable examples of post-tra=\\r\\nining an agent on top of K3 with the Fireworks Training API. Full code exam=\\r\\nples on GitHub.</span></li>\\r\\n<li><span style=3D\\\"color: #000000;\\\"><span style=3D\\\"font-size: 15px;\\\"><stron=\\r\\ng>Open Q&amp;A</strong>: ask us anything about K3, Fireworks, fine-tuning, =\\r\\nor AI in general.</span><br><br></span></li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\n<p style=3D\\\"font-weight:bold; font-size:18px; line-height:175%\\\"><span style=\\r\\n=3D\\\"color: #000000;\\\">About the speakers</span></p>\\r\\n<p style=3D\\\"line-height:175%\\\"><span style=3D\\\"color: #000000;\\\">&nbsp;</span>=\\r\\n</p></div></div></td></tr></tbody></table>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n<!--[if gte mso 9]></table><![endif]-->\\r\\n<!--[if (mso)|(IE)]></td><![endif]-->\\r\\n    <!--[if (mso)|(IE)]></tr></table><![endif]-->\\r\\n    </div>\\r\\n  =20\\r\\n  </div>\\r\\n  <div id=3D\\\"section_17853599488666\\\" class=3D\\\"hse-section\\\" style=3D\\\"padding=\\r\\n-left:10px; padding-right:10px\\\">\\r\\n   =20\\r\\n   =20\\r\\n      <div class=3D\\\"hse-column-container\\\" style=3D\\\"min-width:280px; max-wid=\\r\\nth:600px; margin:0 auto; background-color:#fffffe\\\" bgcolor=3D\\\"#fffffe\\\">\\r\\n   =20\\r\\n    <!--[if (mso)|(IE)]>\\r\\n      <table align=3D\\\"center\\\" style=3D\\\"width:600px;\\\" cellpadding=3D\\\"0\\\" cell=\\r\\nspacing=3D\\\"0\\\" role=3D\\\"presentation\\\" width=3D\\\"600\\\" bgcolor=3D\\\"#fffffe\\\">\\r\\n      <tr style=3D\\\"background-color:#fffffe;\\\">\\r\\n    <![endif]-->\\r\\n    <!--[if (mso)|(IE)]>\\r\\n  <td valign=3D\\\"top\\\" style=3D\\\"width:200px;\\\">\\r\\n<![endif]-->\\r\\n<!--[if gte mso 9]>\\r\\n  <table role=3D\\\"presentation\\\" width=3D\\\"200\\\" cellpadding=3D\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\r\\n=3D\\\"0\\\" style=3D\\\"width:200px\\\">\\r\\n<![endif]-->\\r\\n<div id=3D\\\"column-1785359948866-0\\\" class=3D\\\"hse-column hse-size-4\\\">\\r\\n  <div id=3D\\\"hs_cos_wrapper_module_17853599488662\\\" class=3D\\\"hs_cos_wrapper =\\r\\nhs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_module\\\" style=3D\\\"color: inherit; =\\r\\nfont-size: inherit; line-height: inherit;\\\" data-hs-cos-general-type=3D\\\"widg=\\r\\net\\\" data-hs-cos-type=3D\\\"module\\\"><table class=3D\\\"hse-image-wrapper\\\" role=3D\\\"=\\r\\npresentation\\\" width=3D\\