G1so4qvvw9aVMvPfW/nvyALgvSlCMDZxc7xVXLLaMF5papXw1AF79rN\\r\\n         p552j7I9rEOlyZM1zKJy79HbjhuA==; q=dns/txt; t=1785545355; \\r\\n        x=1785808155;\\r\\nReturn-Path: <1axcb9ndeujldbiy25v1shjnjwmo3jqtzgyyv8@bf08.na2.hubspotemail.net>\\r\\nX-HS-Cid: 1axfkkc9tt807x2usfzrjumn8t4j60fldzshz8\\r\\nList-Unsubscribe: <mailto:1axdrzu7qz3ako35xbmkpfo9bq8y6ioi6u6850@bf08.na2.hubspotemail.net?subject=unsubscribe>, <https://hs-44215135.s.hubspotemail-na2.net/subscription-preferences/v2/unsubscribe-all?data=aV2rkd-7FxTdGN4ksnylR95rfW7SX_Tq4_YRXMW3JLqtm7HJVG5W7ZP4mp6qkbrlW5rtzlk7dvsVHW2wJX0w8JB6lmW4nGrGZ8g0d0nW2WJ4f_2MSc_CVppMd410mgTLW2x8y-64RtkYvW4ctpB059gzTyW8cJhrb81qx0_VjKJgY8jY2dQ395-2>\\r\\nDate: Fri, 31 Jul 2026 21:07:46 -0400\\r\\nFrom: Fireworks AI <product@fireworks.ai>\\r\\nReply-To: marketing@fireworks.ai\\r\\nTo: iltonwaniawski88@tempmailcf.dpdns.org\\r\\nMessage-ID: <1785545353642.1b31a5c9-4c15-4079-9baa-7a29561f1274@bf08.na2.hubspotemail.net>\\r\\nSubject: Kimi K3 is live with serverless training. Nexus ships. Webinars\\r\\n next week.\\r\\nMIME-Version: 1.0\\r\\nContent-Type: multipart/alternative; \\r\\n\\tboundary=\\\"----=_Part_6894_692353351.1785545355882\\\"\\r\\nX-Report-Abuse-To: abuse@hubspot.com (see\\r\\n https://policy.hubspot.com/abuse-complaints)\\r\\nList-Unsubscribe-Post: List-Unsubscribe=One-Click\\r\\nFeedback-ID: ae0lywh:aiuquex:aipuz:HubSpot\\r\\n\\r\\n------=_Part_6894_692353351.1785545355882\\r\\nContent-Type: text/plain; charset=utf-8\\r\\nContent-Transfer-Encoding: quoted-printable\\r\\n\\r\\nKimi K3 sees rapid adoption, Fireworks Nexus delivers intelligent routing t=\\r\\no reduce AI spend 3-5x, and two webinars next week: live K3 training demo T=\\r\\nuesday, real cost of AI work with Arize Thursday.\\r\\n\\r\\nFireworks Community,\\r\\n\\r\\nHappy Friday. AI land has continued to reject the summer slowdown typical o=\\r\\nf big tech. After Fable 5 export controls last month, GLM 5.2 emerged as th=\\r\\ne key alternative. This week, Moonshot released Kimi K3, and it immediately=\\r\\n became the top-ranked open model. It was the first open model to reach #1 =\\r\\non the Frontend Code Arena (https://d5bPYQ04.na2.hubspotlinks.com/Ctc/ZX+11=\\r\\n3/d5bPYQ04/VVzrfQ7m9v6RW4rYWsb1wzfb2W4dVnpw5S8DdfN6crjq23pyd0W95jsWP6lZ3nvV=\\r\\nNv0nW2_29szW2_5sQS8qLjlFW2R0lLK7C0Cf6W8xVBc631JgndW15gr3f5XxWm6N82tBwTfKRb5=\\r\\nW94c1gz5S9W6qVtBDVT84xRGhW7G7hfL1PLLzXN85YmnM139-VW5S4fzs6dM_lqW6wj1ZK5-MqT=\\r\\n0W51fTMx1Cwn-JV9lMZy3qVGSWW5tzYr8397DnwW3102Dt6wR4N7MG4rsMy58rdW96C-QH3klGQ=\\r\\n2W1T0nLZ4yygh_W4hypCt8vj3vhW8D8Mp63cggtDW6lX7qj2LVfXkW75-dhC4wGm2kN8BwkWfC9=\\r\\njFLVdlpNt6xH21bW3jQn6t6RwMq0W9gqJps3xwBFPW5cSs2H1HF2_SW8p-RhZ3Q36DLW4kWFf_1=\\r\\n5hrxKf6GjmBv04 )  and the Fireworks community is quickly adopting Kimi K3, =\\r\\nwith ~10x the token usage compared to the first week of GLM 5.2.\\r\\n\\r\\nKimi K3 is live on Fireworks\\r\\n\\r\\nKimi K3 is a 2.8 trillion parameter model with a 1 million token context wi=\\r\\nndow, available on Fireworks today for both inference and training. Kimi is=\\r\\n competitive with Fable 5 (https://d5bPYQ04.na2.hubspotlinks.com/Ctc/ZX+113=\\r\\n/d5bPYQ04/VVzrfQ7m9v6RW4rYWsb1wzfb2W4dVnpw5S8DdfN6crjpM3pyd0W8wLKSR6lZ3mLW9=\\r\\n5r8Hd1K1DSMW7M-6rj8QHRcDW455B064VqMQ1W8ycfzz4q0WwJW4JcS7W4r94r8W82xs4P3Vb_d=\\r\\n3W2fFRGt5_DZMlW3b1Mkj3MNbYcN7kNTGHmYM7PW5ZBLBQ6C9zC_W4jRKyg8WGg16N3wYPQ4YTH=\\r\\n6-V8Q2hd1TvDWQW8-j6FC8lP2jRW52Wvmy3R7SQWN56x-yDqnZqFW5ZxjW553kfzPW5fWLpZ49w=\\r\\nd6LW5-d2_C5DYVYcN15tssTKsfsqW7npYQl2rnD88W8bCtr_4pf4g7W9lPwrs5R0cl8Vg2RWp5m=\\r\\nMdKdW8x3XZM6TFP6CW6tx4wn2LJ02VN8pxkY9CW5fPW2JRs737Jhgzsf8PZ-Lg04 ) , and in=\\r\\ndependent benchmarks across legal analysis, multimodal reasoning, and agent=\\r\\nic coding put it in the range of Opus 5 and GPT-5.5. Day-zero partners incl=\\r\\nuded Vercel (https://d5bPYQ04.na2.hubspotlinks.com/Ctc/ZX+113/d5bPYQ04/VVzr=\\r\\nfQ7m9v6RW4rYWsb1wzfb2W4dVnpw5S8DdfN6crjq23pyd0W95jsWP6lZ3p8W2LwZRl3gcPkRVhD=\\r\\nyZP8PZjsNN2_ZwRhdTGdXW71qL0v7__msVW2FL1pD6qzbx7W1Y8sDK5j2xk2W29WZ2Q8Qlx5CW5=\\r\\nSq2BP2RqgZ6W3fm1vQ6V6bzBTCh4j8c3zhTVVkJ2m7TrW4NW4V7dWl69BM_9W5GKfr18rXKYNW3=\\r\\njsB288yYMZHW3jNvBZ4g2CNQW8BDMbx4vfQxSW78CR-N2WHs3xW38tQ1r8Tv3MKW507nLS3Kxq9=\\r\\n6VSBmsh29nS7vW3Xq13s7gxwTtW5VVg8l1bYzBCW5Yctny51gb0XW7LlnjS6_mlQfN1p219Vwt8=\\r\\nVhN2j1vrqVwH6jN4M0nm5BWVkWW7K5PWw8tVHZHN3g8PlsTCWghW6tp7mD2L5Hk0f94rwkq04 )=\\r\\n to Mercor (https://d5bPYQ04.na2.hubspotlinks.com/Ctc/ZX+113/d5bPYQ04/VVzrf=\\r\\nQ7m9v6RW4rYWsb1wzfb2W4dVnpw5S8DdfN6crjq23pyd0W95jsWP6lZ3l4W2cGz5d5Mh-5gF48-=\\r\\n66qxsp2W2lhjr83pkRbsW1VC22G8mtjMCW2ZBYHs909byrW4lpklw3-yd8DW4XPPD83FlHskN8W=\\r\\nN3cqlLZcgW73TshJ8vjB0xVLR0tN1SyvSxW8jpmNn8c-wKBW8qptBT9dv_L7W5c4sK78GpP44VS=\\r\\ndMnf3F0q75W5Czm9M5rLG4gW5yfYM65wpMSGW2jcycY16km1WVL5vbK3DKLFdVQ0Zws1Rx9QwVp=\\r\\nZsp54b9VKJW1PFpGH8XPctNW6-Fv7L55tdgcW8kKkjq6h6GKDW4G6pLZ7zjGzhW7SjdV44Xv5hF=\\r\\nW36_hJ72QKgtRW1W99NG6VW9w2VsRBnR61W4tCW2pcN6d3ZcP3mW1c_rrm1Qw-Qmf2-KsxM04 )=\\r\\n to Notion (https://d5bPYQ04.na2.hubspotlinks.com/Ctc/ZX+113/d5bPYQ04/VVzrf=\\r\\nQ7m9v6RW4rYWsb1wzfb2W4dVnpw5S8DdfN6crjq23pyd0W95jsWP6lZ3nXW8VDf957s8dvKW7SB=\\r\\n2w25R1YghW1S2vY270PljcVP8GB68k-TBMW6JsGyL7GSG2nW7N5ZhH8rplTFV-DPL73H0KK5W6S=\\r\\nm0HX4WX4pDW3-ZvL52dDL-4W2w1qHr5Ck0cKW9c00GL7QF67wW41tScw3Ycz1YW2nwtZk6zFdSr=\\r\\nW1W1gLl89VnpjW8WsslR9dzDX0W6lCcLq16ph6GW72LMGT1SfdfXW2QyPcb7x40RsW5r55r86fp=\\r\\nV4NMLqGTVTFdDDW8tYW4G1CXlpQW5qNG6N2DTcBsW4pQPsj96JQXWW7QmFwg2KJlSsW1pm_Qb8R=\\r\\nT33HW6Wd78K1C1GJVV5PPkv5f3DjWW8F0SKD3trkJPW4z3bRK3h17cNW6GtDH987KyqMf5TrYpF=\\r\\n04 ) and Cursor (https://d5bPYQ04.na2.hubspotlinks.com/Ctc/ZX+113/d5bPYQ04/=\\r\\nVVzrfQ7m9v6RW4rYWsb1wzfb2W4dVnpw5S8DdfN6crjq23pyd0W95jsWP6lZ3ltW8yxZVJ3_tBj=\\r\\n0W7gmj7l1cpdClW87Qtw45dgpHPN54Qq83D00d1W5fP-8T379cV8W86J7GY8QLKlCW6gXKbf2wP=\\r\\nV3CW1wng_h1m_xDQW7N86QD7c-mDfW4LvBvJ3Cm9f8VQGMyz1qy5KhW78P_n55gNbS_N7MD1mKv=\\r\\ndx1ZW8nk00P3n2_5lW2M375N3hplMvW7pSwR61fH4YbW6PBFDw894p-kW3rjw_F4_ZbZlW78565=\\r\\nw6Jc4ldW5h3XNR61-P1xW75xwlc5PK6MFW2wrmYb3G-M1qW51hHGq7rbH13W5Y710h6vN0tSW1s=\\r\\n6b-48SG4GYW6pSTFW86FWtlW4WTzLn1Y97HXW6_hdcG4jnqTHW6_s6dh99g94jW24fcXK8bdtMn=\\r\\nf3tvvkF04 ) . Likewise, Cognition=E2=80=99s own Silas Alberti (SVP of Resea=\\r\\nrch) had this praise to share:\\r\\n\\r\\nWe trust Fireworks for high-quality Kimi K3 inference, allowing us to evalu=\\r\\nate the model smoothly on FrontierCode. The results made it clear that Kimi=\\r\\n K3 represents a step change for open-source models.\\r\\n\\r\\nWith US-only endpoints and zero data retention (https://d5bPYQ04.na2.hubspo=\\r\\ntlinks.com/Ctc/ZX+113/d5bPYQ04/VVzrfQ7m9v6RW4rYWsb1wzfb2W4dVnpw5S8DdfN6crjm=\\r\\n-5n4LbW50kH_H6lZ3q7W1f0VS58LvrvDW4Wfw6c1rLyQCW2kfqQb8N_HhCW7p4kwD122VvcW2L4=\\r\\nSxn6ghpHgW729j4B261rxQW3QX_Ry7zZSHJW2mqV_C6NMYhVW5tFBrp3yRGWxM3WdT6KbMZWW46=\\r\\nzCrw7NqKN2W3dxlQw4-dYZcVD0CGy7Kzsk1VyPS9R8MVFB7W5RWrLk25xyS1W80PhGW4KCddNW7=\\r\\n5HfM_86GM6xW4QH18z4dj2R8VRXhdd1LDML0W3XlQGl46Km-fW6CQC3l1f7VNZW3z57xP8V0s2J=\\r\\nV7X82D3nfJktN2JnN_0J1nNfW4ydq_D8k2TvyW2l33rk89px6qR5B75pfCJW2sY4SD1CdKz6W35=\\r\\nymjG47XhPBW94HxNl1_CXDCN3Zd0rHbrbH2W5HrbPK74n8fcf41ZNBv04 ) , Kimi K3 is re=\\r\\nady for regulated industries like finance and healthcare.\\r\\n\\r\\nTry Kimi K3\\r\\n(https://d5bPYQ04.na2.hubspotlinks.com/Ctc/ZX+113/d5bPYQ04/VVzrfQ7m9v6RW4rY=\\r\\nWsb1wzfb2W4dVnpw5S8DdfN6crjq23pyd0W95jsWP6lZ3lyW8sgN6x1Tj-G6W5CTbsD8XKl0VW6=\\r\\nhpwkl4C_MDNW5Md7dJ4jTQ22N8S-CslYMPc8N5gc0Bml_qh-W4Xzngy7KWfJDW5v_0x81WfzJWW=\\r\\n6n2GWq4wvH5wW1rwzn97wCysGVn0L-W8S4LK0W95bgb8791NKfW6qMv476P94tWW43HT7-59p8s=\\r\\nPW7-gg0_1jlC1hW7z-fX08g3MGDW7G7jp27TBcGNW4ry22X3H6wSzVQRCsJ2K6XxlW3NXFd31yR=\\r\\n37fW5_r8lR3sDf9DW75NKV-2vr-KfW1cXBjM5CbVBkN4gMrLx274TXW671FBG7LrVYfW75vKy21=\\r\\nZhyk8W6ZLvFZ5VpPSRW81ykd18MzP6zVjFm5D1ZfDMyW3ys_tX8W9XMgf1rk95604 )\\r\\n\\r\\nLastly, we're giving away five free Fire Passes next week. To enter, share =\\r\\nwhat you build with #KimiK3onFireworks (https://d5bPYQ04.na2.hubspotlinks.c=\\r\\nom/Ctc/ZX+113/d5bPYQ04/VVzrfQ7m9v6RW4rYWsb1wzfb2W4dVnpw5S8DdfN6crjq23pyd0W9=\\r\\n5jsWP6lZ3mDW2R2Mh36qt91KW8q6TY05v0tzYW5q6cqL7D-B3QVB5f0Z1SjFtyW6kS-mn3q8Yd-=\\r\\nVyJRG38VsQb6N6rsSqbYWswXW3qbdfB5z6j0ZN96W4xJzDDvhVCCfPx43HB-8W8GrL5M2kBLLyW=\\r\\n62Ymfm7qZ2KdV3ChK074wt8kW8qVSdx2x1sLwW6FWF5M1YcfN_W3_wc0L32SWWkN9bjxSHYFLYT=\\r\\nVpq9GG7mLP55W3k-9Vx4s5sKZW116ND71SvnTCN55fGBCj1RspW8F2CD85VhxltW1x6Qvd2CGGy=\\r\\nzM2fphzS78gqW3Kg0Nd5xkjwNW2Wmj8q6LcrV_W43YzkC4lLfSjW9kwVT_6TnQGtW11d2B75c0r=\\r\\n-nW2NPHr82h02Wyf5PyJc204 ) . Contest ends August 4th, 5pm PT.\\r\\n\\r\\nTrain K3 on your own data\\r\\n\\r\\nServerless training for Kimi K3 also went live on Monday. With a one-line S=\\r\\nDK change, jobs run on shared GPUs so you can pay per token with no idle co=\\r\\nsts or headaches wrangling GPU clusters. Full details to run LoRA on K3 are=\\r\\n here. (https://d5bPYQ04.na2.hubspotlinks.com/Ctc/ZX+113/d5bPYQ04/VVzrfQ7m9=\\r\\nv6RW4rYWsb1wzfb2W4dVnpw5S8DdfN6crjpM3pyd0W8wLKSR6lZ3nSW2K201b5gxdcNN53pfrzN=\\r\\ns9dGW4-GSKn546Bt9W8qhFNy5259n7W61MtyX8pwJ5ZW1jQ6h_1tzDS5W3BfbbL5-Y1gmW3FRBR=\\r\\nJ73gM8dM_Fc3KJ4GswN2Qdjvv3CCdmW50VtM_7HnzswW6q9CK98gyktzW8xxV2S6-Nzm7W1WBH0=\\r\\nz4kjR7xW6mDWC74_pmjRW7PbT3L8gPN8cW4XhzBp7y6bsBN7QzHnzcg7-KW4NCYdK6hkhS2W6Ly=\\r\\n6Q-4v5ZyhW3mL1FQ9hkl7tW983T0B1gS8hGW7YmncG7j8FY6W4skbDQ6jCP8VW4cKfp17jW7bGW=\\r\\n3Yxvs11cNLNFW7ZJHVq4Yp7CrW4y0Wbz8qcCLHf8rvc3Y04 )\\r\\n\\r\\nTo help get started, Fireworks has also published a fireworks-training skil=\\r\\nl (https://d5bPYQ04.na2.hubspotlinks.com/Ctc/ZX+113/d5bPYQ04/VVzrfQ7m9v6RW4=\\r\\nrYWsb1wzfb2W4dVnpw5S8DdfN6crjm-5n4LbW50kH_H6lZ3m7W68FX3l7DxYzsW8lwK4T2TQBT5=\\r\\nW4xxVvx5vZ0Q8W4PbW2R50wKK7Vf21Z76K7rHlW2WCh2Z4npWwZW39vdcm5wfJYSW7DmCWM6V43=\\r\\ncPW81vppj87cPFLW7d-c3k5jgBfgW2PR2X86_QgbnN6BsvTw2lPJyW1FGq-m67PDskW6-wCj87J=\\r\\n0lcSW1gnGPw4bHGH9W6JVymR751njKN4dxgHtjsLchW8V4jx81MxjwqW3F2pJP2b8N9QW7CGgtf=\\r\\n7RPc_MVJnpQZ1Hgm7vN3tNVY_NbBjwW7GJKWj4WhxbZW4YMY6321CzmgN5CrnPJvzf8lN5dYKdh=\\r\\npqV9DVZdkXY2LZGhjW94PgHk88hp-5N7ZHGP0JpkT-W5XzC7D6vR9DJW9f4Q5Z2qBlXmW52wCxl=\\r\\n8VwzHkd-5tpq04 ) for Claude Code, Cursor, and Codex. With a one-line instal=\\r\\nl, you just describe your needs, and the coding agent helps you configure t=\\r\\nhe job, validate inputs, estimate costs before spending, and then runs the =\\r\\ntraining job with live troubleshooting of failures.\\r\\n\\r\\nFor those eager for human guidance on training Kimi K3, we=E2=80=99ll also =\\r\\nbe (co)hosting two webinar events next week:\\r\\n\\r\\n- Kimi K3 on Fireworks (https://d5bPYQ04.na2.hubspotlinks.com/Ctc/ZX+113/d5=\\r\\nbPYQ04/VVzrfQ7m9v6RW4rYWsb1wzfb2W4dVnpw5S8DdfN6crjq23pyd0W95jsWP6lZ3p4W6s-5=\\r\\nSy4v3xmBW97Ppg18cTSdDW19lwst1pb7p-W57nvfv4Cnt0nW5F6BtC2pS5C3W6jWhMR46C8s4W7=\\r\\nw8-Kt7VF8rLVRVTPh4XcgcDW5LN3nB5XpBfhW47bbdD5NDtpTW8tp59N6C8JSTV5pZTq9lhJZWV=\\r\\nLvfNT8CQMXfVwXp8h1ZGQ_YW2Q2c5_2QjS4DW8S90LV65sCJSN8xvDk8X-C9CN4-fJFytkJ47VN=\\r\\nyGv_4KZZqQW2q32wz2jFwnSW1GmdZR2Z2XbgW44WmNL12B_bvW266WLn3t_-bFW2lQZX53vLg9c=\\r\\nN3B--krsK8Q1W5H-_Gt5wN_TGW2XqtSP5XqWw1W8PKvSH600Q38W57-tJ21bws-nVkNfMr21Qs5=\\r\\n7dVf_Ql04 ) =E2=80=94 Tuesday, August 4. Live demo, serverless training wal=\\r\\nkthrough, open Q&A.\\r\\n- The Real Cost of AI Work with Arize (https://d5bPYQ04.na2.hubspotlinks.co=\\r\\nm/Ctc/ZX+113/d5bPYQ04/VVzrfQ7m9v6RW4rYWsb1wzfb2W4dVnpw5S8DdfN6crjpM3pyd0W8w=\\r\\nLKSR6lZ3p9W88cTvS82qNk1N3HpFyQHT95rW7NL3m_3p21gYN7LjKKL8K5wDW250v1z7XmB6dW7=\\r\\nrbw8H7xyNgzW2891Cz4F1pCTW99rxtl1DPBlGW2yKh_p3cMZKLW5Y-dqk8D3S0kW7tvj2m2lXWz=\\r\\n_W938GW83wHG8YN44J-dfggxX1W4lKslD1m5HMNW6X-3Tf1GJ9S7W90w7NP1Hp6ymW2JV82_6fR=\\r\\nrNzVVM6g73gWD-xW1WZ6q-1xZVJSW3Y5mM87lnQcDW3s72QG4VM8r7W115Hzz29ZH14N2p8v8TH=\\r\\nmrp_W6PLwkl30QKllW4-lvmg4FWcYzW30zQf58m3VRDW6Szg567FbXLPMJZSXLw5svQf5L8x4M0=\\r\\n4 ) =E2=80=94 Thursday, August 6. 2,400 agent runs, 10 models, what AI work=\\r\\n actually costs.\\r\\n\\r\\nFireworks Nexus: the intelligent routing layer behind your harness\\r\\n\\r\\nFireworks Nexus (https://d5bPYQ04.na2.hubspotlinks.com/Ctc/ZX+113/d5bPYQ04/=\\r\\nVVzrfQ7m9v6RW4rYWsb1wzfb2W4dVnpw5S8DdfN6crjps3pyd0W7Y8-PT6lZ3krW3p5NZt7dMzm=\\r\\n6W7VsJst9lKp45W5zdJnH4WSqdDN2VG2ylMjfLQW985_7637xsRrW3_J1Tf14_RRsW8b8wRt17h=\\r\\nlFkW71qBxw86XwsBW90jnBH8CBfsgVGKg9h8fjwpWW8VdtKk8Jpp_-W99MRS366JYMHW46mH6c6=\\r\\n1-LJkN1wlnZBmF86BVYKP0D6DX9spW1zMTMG3ZnLmgVBbslD1-Q-jPVZZ5jM7fCfdZVtCrlc97v=\\r\\n9MGW2PckJm5BvXFXW8L-bFp3lvJ11W4hWnJn59njFBW7q2Bkf4qkqcfW5bdnV17TyH5fW4ld6PS=\\r\\n3zKjfGVYW6xJ8Zpwtgf86-cM404 ) is now live for all enterprises, addressing t=\\r\\nhe shift toward sustainable tokenomics.\\r\\n\\r\\nNexus is an open-source routing layer that integrates with existing tools t=\\r\\no optimize your model usage across tasks.  FireConnect (https://d5bPYQ04.na=\\r\\n2.hubspotlinks.com/Ctc/ZX+113/d5bPYQ04/VVzrfQ7m9v6RW4rYWsb1wzfb2W4dVnpw5S8D=\\r\\ndfN6crjq23pyd0W95jsWP6lZ3pQW40MKDK6Zx_32W4mNMRL5XstT4VlZwTc22qKnxW8c9Rds6RW=\\r\\n-wrW5vgrsc321BhPW8lgN3q4MjWxQW3XK_xK2DHk8zW5HB2CC28mycvM-DqMc3RlCqW8tzXx880=\\r\\nMynqW8zczdq5d_9-sW3cD-fd2Fm2Y-W14DDpj5Npb9fN4cNw_yGf7kJW4VW0br29PMNrF6m_wJ2=\\r\\n9wvFW7KSxq17CHJPgW1Z10Nd694Q7yW3xz7GG1Gn27mW1TfxdC84WvCFW7HrJnX4j8yV6W8Tv0N=\\r\\nS87gk7MN2w6xQfkVZhzW4XBlVx30fvrhVm-LRj8lzWq6W7WQ2MG7zgw_ZLT4bHrFgxvW2KXCz91=\\r\\nB6y4ZN64k037mYbS8N1jcvlxPKlVlf1YHW_Y04 ) installs in one command and is ope=\\r\\nn source. The Nexus router then intelligently sends routine tasks to K3 or =\\r\\nGLM 5.2 and passes harder tasks through to your closed-source provider (e.g=\\r\\n. Opus 5 or GPT 5.6 sol) using your own key.\\r\\n\\r\\nThe prior month saw a steady stream of research demonstrating the savings a=\\r\\nnd quality gains from routing (see the research from Faros, Arize, and Harv=\\r\\ney ICYMI). This week we moved from research into production. Early results =\\r\\nfrom enterprise teams with hundreds of engineers using Nexus are showing a =\\r\\nsignificant drop in cost per merged PR. If you'd like to trial Fireworks Ne=\\r\\nxus for your team, we=E2=80=99d love to get in touch.\\r\\n\\r\\nBook a Demo\\r\\n(https://d5bPYQ04.na2.hubspotlinks.com/Ctc/ZX+113/d5bPYQ04/VVzrfQ7m9v6RW4rY=\\r\\nWsb1wzfb2W4dVnpw5S8DdfN6crjpM3pyd0W8wLKSR6lZ3nmMM92ZPrc0F-N6x0SYlR0YY8W40pk=\\r\\ndL5cs1XlW4nhmmR1QWfDXW66G6Dy929SdXN8c5S_8KBmrjW3NNCJR1BBxVSW8F6FTF1g7CbTW5y=\\r\\n0sdv7WGYFbW6d23Cz3ZBKGVW5yfg-65c4LS9W9b3VqH6s-ZfPW5Zktrr87QtkWN3rmqk0yYw6SW=\\r\\n3xG5kN7HlpXgW85KTR62cLRH5W26fLq36y1mFXW2HwQpq4hJly5W2gxSNL33slQFW3Slg_12xVC=\\r\\n4GW7MHfDK86c4SqN1rFpJJ272sXW49TxP58Km3bLW6JvM2388tMlqW6ykf4D905y8CW8RhRFQ8c=\\r\\nrBvNW2zxmV837nHNPW6Vc_3F3k84zdf2KR6cq04 )\\r\\n\\r\\nUntil next time, happy building.\\r\\n\\r\\nLinkedIn (https://d5bPYQ04.na2.hubspotlinks.com/Ctc/ZX+113/d5bPYQ04/VVzrfQ7=\\r\\nm9v6RW4rYWsb1wzfb2W4dVnpw5S8DdfN6crjpM3pyd0W8wLKSR6lZ3nmW3NHyh470yp-1Mstjv1=\\r\\nYd_zBW1xxvLd5S-bTvW3Lmhw-169K7sV29BDW5wyFdbW4sC_Xs6pJV0dW98yVk37sd5rnN2mrrC=\\r\\ntBqGW8W6bR6XL74S0RvW3L6mck4KGXCMN641CKXW8WsLN3q9hfhrJLXYW90H8Yf23MVxVW7V9nj=\\r\\ng99ZcTLW6yPLpS7g8RBWW7r81R96T9g_JN8JPX75S1047W5RM-w-1xhvgKN9hdkqbdZS8rW7LhY=\\r\\n7p7cgL9DW5fZSnk9hb2nWW7l26_P4B-sSTW9j_HRm76MZ2LN9fS2l5nDJyqN1q6Jb9vdxYlN5rn=\\r\\n4JLk6sQhW1yxzmD7V2f3-W4Cc2wb5Z8hsbf2rwkM-04 )\\r\\n\\r\\nX (https://d5bPYQ04.na2.hubspotlinks.com/Ctc/ZX+113/d5bPYQ04/VVzrfQ7m9v6RW4=\\r\\nrYWsb1wzfb2W4dVnpw5S8DdfN6crjpM3pyd0W8wLKSR6lZ3l3W8lsF_n1xRVlFW4MPBZL5_PtwW=\\r\\nW6gKMf21fz7sfW46tvV35S4w3cW8cTP539gzf00W48rBGf2RncN7W7GYY3C58ZCDnW6-HMvG2pS=\\r\\nGD7W5z28G63RYNC_N7TGSjblc3y6W4wZ4pd1-R3nxW6mCVMg960j3WW4YrvT359XC5YW1xkfZ21=\\r\\n3cdX4W4cn7Zx2kym1yN6F0XMhdXcn1W5TVMGs6HQ1t1W8D7-6Y7Syrt7W3_GM8_8sdyjgW9f8y8=\\r\\nM4_3RFKW2gJhqj7JpwQRW2bCN6h5lBSNLW84lv9y2FGwYXN288Bsn1jZ-HW5cyFyB9cvzMMV9Jk=\\r\\nrL4XlPGPW6PVhcW2ytFHQN8BHkhW-FN5Vf45mrLY04 )\\r\\n\\r\\ndiscord (https://d5bPYQ04.na2.hubspotlinks.com/Ctc/ZX+113/d5bPYQ04/VVzrfQ7m=\\r\\n9v6RW4rYWsb1wzfb2W4dVnpw5S8DdfN6crjps3pyd0W7Y8-PT6lZ3pDW9dJ3G384Wh_jW86T964=\\r\\n7tZc0LW8klsHv12SCMJW69ff-14w-LtnW5CjfcW4StwMqW93SS5V3CW07zW6sT6Xy3SdNGpVjPR=\\r\\nNv7X7whQW13tVmp22NlHDW50jWW541HR79W7rwN3X1wPBBLW3j9rRt8sl1dPW7wz1dd80K-VCN1=\\r\\nykkdgM61mhW9gBlBN7MNpf9TfVnH2ybmt