ole=3D\\\"presentation\\\" class=3D\\\"hse-body-wrapper-table\\\" cellpad=\\r\\nding=3D\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=3D\\\"0\\\" style=3D\\\"margin:0; padding:0; width:100% !impo=\\r\\nrtant; min-width:320px !important; height:100% !important\\\" width=3D\\\"100%\\\" h=\\r\\neight=3D\\\"100%\\\">\\r\\n        <tbody><tr>\\r\\n          <td class=3D\\\"hse-body-wrapper-td\\\" valign=3D\\\"top\\\" style=3D\\\"font-fa=\\r\\nmily:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:15px; color:#23496d; word-break:break-wor=\\r\\nd; padding-top:20px; padding-bottom:20px\\\">\\r\\n            <div id=3D\\\"hs_cos_wrapper_main\\\" class=3D\\\"hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_=\\r\\nwrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_dnd_area\\\" style=3D\\\"color: inherit; font-=\\r\\nsize: inherit; line-height: inherit;\\\" data-hs-cos-general-type=3D\\\"widget\\\" d=\\r\\nata-hs-cos-type=3D\\\"dnd_area\\\">  <div id=3D\\\"section_178064785038616\\\" class=3D=\\r\\n\\\"hse-section hse-section-first\\\" style=3D\\\"padding-left:10px; padding-right:1=\\r\\n0px\\\">\\r\\n   =20\\r\\n   =20\\r\\n      <div class=3D\\\"hse-column-container\\\" style=3D\\\"min-width:280px; max-wid=\\r\\nth:600px; margin:0 auto; background-color:#ffffff\\\" bgcolor=3D\\\"#ffffff\\\">\\r\\n   =20\\r\\n    <!--[if (mso)|(IE)]>\\r\\n      <table align=3D\\\"center\\\" style=3D\\\"width:600px;\\\" cellpadding=3D\\\"0\\\" cell=\\r\\nspacing=3D\\\"0\\\" role=3D\\\"presentation\\\" width=3D\\\"600\\\" bgcolor=3D\\\"#ffffff\\\">\\r\\n      <tr style=3D\\\"background-color:#ffffff;\\\">\\r\\n    <![endif]-->\\r\\n    <!--[if (mso)|(IE)]>\\r\\n  <td valign=3D\\\"top\\\" style=3D\\\"width:600px;\\\">\\r\\n<![endif]-->\\r\\n<!--[if gte mso 9]>\\r\\n  <table role=3D\\\"presentation\\\" width=3D\\\"600\\\" cellpadding=3D\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\r\\n=3D\\\"0\\\" style=3D\\\"width:600px\\\">\\r\\n<![endif]-->\\r\\n<div id=3D\\\"column-1780647850386-0\\\" class=3D\\\"hse-column hse-size-12\\\">\\r\\n    <table role=3D\\\"presentation\\\" cellpadding=3D\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=3D\\\"0\\\" width=\\r\\n=3D\\\"100%\\\" class=3D\\\"\\\" style=3D\\\"\\\"><tbody><tr><td class=3D\\\"hs_padded\\\" style=3D=\\r\\n\\\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:15px; color:#23496d; word-break:b=\\r\\nreak-word; padding:10px 20px\\\"><div id=3D\\\"hs_cos_wrapper_module_178064785038=\\r\\n62\\\" class=3D\\\"hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_modul=\\r\\ne\\\" style=3D\\\"color: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit;\\\" data=\\r\\n-hs-cos-general-type=3D\\\"widget\\\" data-hs-cos-type=3D\\\"module\\\"><div id=3D\\\"hs_c=\\r\\nos_wrapper_module_17806478503862_\\\" class=3D\\\"hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_w=\\r\\nidget hs_cos_wrapper_type_rich_text\\\" style=3D\\\"color: inherit; font-size: in=\\r\\nherit; line-height: inherit;\\\" data-hs-cos-general-type=3D\\\"widget\\\" data-hs-c=\\r\\nos-type=3D\\\"rich_text\\\"><p style=3D\\\"line-height:175%\\\">Fireworks Community,</p=\\r\\n>\\r\\n<p style=3D\\\"line-height:175%\\\">&nbsp;</p>\\r\\n<p style=3D\\\"line-height:175%\\\">Happy Friday. AI land has continued to reject=\\r\\n the summer slowdown typical of big tech. After Fable 5 export controls las=\\r\\nt month, GLM 5.2 emerged as the&nbsp;key alternative. This week, Moonshot r=\\r\\neleased Kimi K3, and it immediately became the top-ranked open model. It wa=\\r\\ns the first open model to reach #1 on the <a href=3D\\\"https://d5bPYQ04.na2.h=\\r\\nubspotlinks.com/Ctc/ZX+113/d5bPYQ04/VVzrfQ7m9v6RW4rYWsb1wzfb2W4dVnpw5S8DdfN=\\r\\n6crjm-5nXHCW50kH_H6lZ3q1W1yWKmQ2nPS6LW24gv9q6LS4crW8yQd9V5_C0TjW2RjP5j7680M=\\r\\nBW1tlLBR5xgHCbW26qBYh6_fT6tW4ZSd1q1gfccnVfFfgg42zYWSVb-0_w5128SXMG6W1tKR4J2=\\r\\nW6cRGvK510t9yMG64YRgYXBLN5X2LtmJ0NxsW7GZWZb6cTRw7W8WM8DB5LcSF_W8pLQhc5XFcBV=\\r\\nW2-jQXp7R3bGNW1bXmsQ7qpz1WV4wJRj7RnWbWW1SkkVw34GbrCW4mBpQ47YHG3_W1Hdp_11qMy=\\r\\nThW81vsMd2lzWrzN15pLDX4sZzrW68xgcx7fnF--W656B8t3ChT3MV1SG0W8wGBnVW70F3Y_70G=\\r\\nPRcW6M7GNR7HV43RW5nHPR02j107FN4Y_Wp51C23kW21PfpF2l8Jbqf514TBT04\\\" style=3D\\\"c=\\r\\nolor:#00a4bd\\\" data-hs-link-id=3D\\\"0\\\" data-hs-link-id-v2=3D\\\"kQnFFvi6\\\" target=\\r\\n=3D\\\"_blank\\\">Frontend Code Arena</a>&nbsp;and the Fireworks community is qui=\\r\\nckly adopting Kimi K3, with ~10x the token usage compared to the first week=\\r\\n of GLM 5.2.</p></div></div></td></tr></tbody></table>\\r\\n  <table role=3D\\\"presentation\\\" cellpadding=3D\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=3D\\\"0\\\" width=3D=\\r\\n\\\"100%\\\" class=3D\\\"\\\" style=3D\\\"\\\"><tbody><tr><td class=3D\\\"hs_padded\\\" style=3D\\\"fo=\\r\\nnt-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:15px; color:#23496d; word-break:brea=\\r\\nk-word; padding:10px 20px\\\"><div id=3D\\\"hs_cos_wrapper_module_17806478503864\\\"=\\r\\n class=3D\\\"hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_module\\\" =\\r\\nstyle=3D\\\"color: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit;\\\" data-hs=\\r\\n-cos-general-type=3D\\\"widget\\\" data-hs-cos-type=3D\\\"module\\\"><div id=3D\\\"hs_cos_=\\r\\nwrapper_module_17806478503864_\\\" class=3D\\\"hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widg=\\r\\net hs_cos_wrapper_type_rich_text\\\" style=3D\\\"color: inherit; font-size: inher=\\r\\nit; line-height: inherit;\\\" data-hs-cos-general-type=3D\\\"widget\\\" data-hs-cos-=\\r\\ntype=3D\\\"rich_text\\\"><h3 style=3D\\\"font-size:17px; margin:0; line-height:175%\\\"=\\r\\n><strong>Kimi K3 is live on Fireworks</strong></h3>\\r\\n<p style=3D\\\"line-height:175%\\\">&nbsp;</p>\\r\\n<p style=3D\\\"line-height:175%\\\">Kimi K3 is a 2.8 trillion parameter model wit=\\r\\nh a 1 million token context window, available on Fireworks today for both i=\\r\\nnference and training. <a href=3D\\\"https://d5bPYQ04.na2.hubspotlinks.com/Ctc=\\r\\n/ZX+113/d5bPYQ04/VVzrfQ7m9v6RW4rYWsb1wzfb2W4dVnpw5S8DdfN6crjq23qn9qW95jsWP6=\\r\\nlZ3pqVnvCJn1DzX4qW1dl_6l7fckTmW7cFywX3fMFbkW5NKtC-3_VY2TW1_LS0w2hRGSpN460KJ=\\r\\nKK0HNtW8cd5Sc7fDm7fW8G9wX25J-X6NW8TpXCj3zFG8bW3n46Bk4kB_x0W2tnzrm6g4D0vMZFw=\\r\\ngYQF9kMW2m4sng1yScDLW8wTB7w26m8wrW9krMbX3vF53ZW8HXZpS520rNWW3ZkvT253sy3bVp7=\\r\\nrvJ12GCvqW23DZQg9408VjW6GmJZ611562HW2zZ5yQ2cTyZFW14YhlV1KnVnfW1_Wfhp5vNzZYW=\\r\\n6kWySS3VcbHpW2YMQBb6NpMFJW233G5l3fbP5qW1Y8NHs5VD6p0W7P_n_K2x5zXXW3ZH5wB3Gr6=\\r\\n3jW7pKqtD748v4xf3mG5tT04\\\" style=3D\\\"color:#00a4bd\\\" data-hs-link-id=3D\\\"0\\\" dat=\\r\\na-hs-link-id-v2=3D\\\"nhnWmzzY\\\" target=3D\\\"_blank\\\">Kimi is competitive with Fab=\\r\\nle 5</a>, and independent benchmarks across legal analysis, multimodal reas=\\r\\noning, and agentic coding put it in the range of Opus 5 and GPT-5.5. Day-ze=\\r\\nro partners included <a href=3D\\\"https://d5bPYQ04.na2.hubspotlinks.com/Ctc/Z=\\r\\nX+113/d5bPYQ04/VVzrfQ7m9v6RW4rYWsb1wzfb2W4dVnpw5S8DdfN6crjm-5nXHCW50kH_H6lZ=\\r\\n3nhW9frhKL7wpkHxW9hZQH26Bkw98W2-9Q1n1JBjDhM9_y3vTZNGfW4TfYYJ4hYxbyW1rBS193h=\\r\\n-JGkV3Jn2K6qWQf9W4jnTd881J2WtW2k3cTs30Jb1zW5D60B-11PrpgW5THgXG9hV26jW8yykk-=\\r\\n2Lwsj7N5JG5yWvc997W2YdntF6gnjvwW6-1KLP6RhcGmMkHl_0YbybDVHSkY17XVCqHW4vf0Z83=\\r\\nStlJgW2KVs0h6mGWFlV95Ts82ppXclW6tzlq52SqQkmW53Wlwl5w1_JrVD5n-_7TnGV1W7cxvG8=\\r\\n3fmfs2W5j-rmY7pvzfcW11JqFv2vMYYnW3Yn-Md9jG1p_W3QQ8Nf1Xt3fNW5yWvD33Yf6m_W6h8=\\r\\n7jF4VZb5XVv1Qn627tcBYW60jSKQ5SB7s2f8vBk8H04\\\" style=3D\\\"color:#00a4bd\\\" data-h=\\r\\ns-link-id=3D\\\"0\\\" data-hs-link-id-v2=3D\\\"ach6MThH\\\" target=3D\\\"_blank\\\">Vercel</a=\\r\\n> to <a href=3D\\\"https://d5bPYQ04.na2.hubspotlinks.com/Ctc/ZX+113/d5bPYQ04/V=\\r\\nVzrfQ7m9v6RW4rYWsb1wzfb2W4dVnpw5S8DdfN6crjm-5nXHCW50kH_H6lZ3mvV-D8fn8yj-bqW=\\r\\n6fhZqm5_gJrZV8xXgw2mxxG9W1YcrJR2v2fdkW1ryL1S4xHF_sW65XXvN6mpRbgW2bnM1L80bKV=\\r\\nmW5LCYR042lGqyN2NNwkkCM4kXW11mzfc2MkX1BW39vS_73PTwTQW4js4Wb38fC7wW5fqYSx3wh=\\r\\nXDYW6c5FHV8-tJxFW9hlDN-4m-kgcW7ZPRn811yVvCW6DLQ7_7jc2gWW2pGS3H2fgpBcW7xQ5lq=\\r\\n578s8CW2XxnNl4lrWgRVKDT285xNWLjW6nLMyZ3Q0YfdMGKbwsnhmpmW4zcYwN8_6p_nW6wY9-n=\\r\\n7QfhhRW8PSrL-14mR7BW3fCvwX7HNKXsV69SLQ7fSTL9VhgmX-7r25N1W21cGf920T5y-W5G3rB=\\r\\nF5XW7ZbN4GKSbm72kBRf2LPCzd04\\\" style=3D\\\"color:#00a4bd\\\" data-hs-link-id=3D\\\"0\\\"=\\r\\n data-hs-link-id-v2=3D\\\"GRhDUaVM\\\" target=3D\\\"_blank\\\">Mercor</a> to <a href=3D=\\r\\n\\\"https://d5bPYQ04.na2.hubspotlinks.com/Ctc/ZX+113/d5bPYQ04/VVzrfQ7m9v6RW4rY=\\r\\nWsb1wzfb2W4dVnpw5S8DdfN6crjq23qn9qW95jsWP6lZ3pWN8VWhwfGySMqW6JSVLf5vKMngW4w=\\r\\nG5Rk6CF9hWW36mY6R6mgCb3W5W67yG88LNtrW8N0tXP405X_tW5M-GMC1t3StMW1C2Mg132RtbY=\\r\\nVNRDls4pclLQW7FMtNL7CX4TQW8t7gJD3m7MDXW3n0MxF6tVFcnW8rXMnc6TXtxTW2YDrT36nvB=\\r\\n_5W33GXWC1qR0xFW7TdnW22ppNw0W27sL_07dSrBVV-rQ0k5_LtftW6FbT8s6CW5xkW4hwLNr6l=\\r\\n5dwpW18Sqk01Vrq5jW2SdM7s62f681N3rWtVGlJjLyW3XdL0T8Bkx8nW46gK3x39_47nN4cFS1p=\\r\\nJP907V5ww6c5ssz7YW5vsSzW11SvzDW6yY9G88S8tddVPHdJv5T6p5Hf1-nC0004\\\" style=3D\\\"=\\r\\ncolor:#00a4bd\\\" data-hs-link-id=3D\\\"0\\\" data-hs-link-id-v2=3D\\\"DoSfzrYY\\\" target=\\r\\n=3D\\\"_blank\\\">Notion</a> and <a href=3D\\\"https://d5bPYQ04.na2.hubspotlinks.com=\\r\\n/Ctc/ZX+113/d5bPYQ04/VVzrfQ7m9v6RW4rYWsb1wzfb2W4dVnpw5S8DdfN6crjm-5nXHCW50k=\\r\\nH_H6lZ3nLVJTCzR5d3HtKVRYK3-45ZQrTW5-vVRb2Ph0VzW6qfvK82q_Hq3W1H0Gfs1gbNHcN7W=\\r\\ng0lktjdSpN63GgsZW6l4JW104ZWM68K_6gVvw_H15Jgg_PW283nhz9kD9p5VV000x2tvnHgW80Y=\\r\\nJ0T89VQznVfQwGm3xWXrMW35D3FK8sMSmzN5cZrxdcfN_dW65B5jp1CJ4DZW146mGD6dv4pDW6R=\\r\\nsl434qtWv2W3yhk_Z71K-LZW6X9D7L95TTgWW8QHXst8nKbWLW1BzhpV4GykGMW6C6JCl7-B0Xj=\\r\\nVZ0szh72v9YbW3Hh1Hp6_q8CLW8cMt6b8wqjMDN1x55tGSVbn6W2z8G_T2JZvTKW490Ly263rXM=\\r\\n3W1yrNhJ6tR1KCW77d_sf2Q-C-5W4W6-f04w7lRwf3_zlYR04\\\" style=3D\\\"color:#00a4bd\\\" =\\r\\ndata-hs-link-id=3D\\\"0\\\" data-hs-link-id-v2=3D\\\"dVSXhWUp\\\" target=3D\\\"_blank\\\">Cur=\\r\\nsor</a>. Likewise, Cognition=E2=80=99s own Silas Alberti (SVP of Research) =\\r\\nhad this praise to share:</p>\\r\\n<p style=3D\\\"line-height:175%; padding-left:30px\\\"><span style=3D\\\"white-space=\\r\\n-collapse: preserve;\\\"><br></span><em>We trust Fireworks for high-quality Ki=\\r\\nmi K3 inference, allowing us to evaluate the model smoothly on FrontierCode=\\r\\n. The results made it clear that Kimi K3 represents a step change for open-=\\r\\nsource models.</em></p>\\r\\n<p style=3D\\\"line-height:175%\\\">&nbsp;</p>\\r\\n<p style=3D\\\"line-height:175%\\\">With US-only endpoints and <a href=3D\\\"https:/=\\r\\n/d5bPYQ04.na2.hubspotlinks.com/Ctc/ZX+113/d5bPYQ04/VVzrfQ7m9v6RW4rYWsb1wzfb=\\r\\n2W4dVnpw5S8DdfN6crjng5nXHCW5BWr2F6lZ3p5W7rvG9m6VxfYWW1MKxrc4gz89JW6MzL848qw=\\r\\nZw0W2QQ2T313XSp_N5vmDmD4H_pQW3BmF1N5LnMGZW8xFth657xNPJW51HTJ66BtvrkW34HYdn7=\\r\\n42KH7W8Hfd6G8SN1C4W7w7ZVQ4yw5q5W4JZgkP8dTg2XW1y0zlM3X61ZPW7nWHls4N4KbJW53YL=\\r\\nLJ1JjfjHN8fGm32F9qNLW8rDJ3s5P_LN5VxtXyR6X32L9W4Dkrw8132njMW8YJZR34K1zYlW7L9=\\r\\nwG477XwlsW7FBQYK7C9HSmW4vBsk06Gww2TW7z0RF58g6nstW4hb1bs2jQs_JW1xWXKq917WG9W=\\r\\n11HxkR8L7LyCW1bjj1B6h6f9KW707XXW2lySD7W2DtKjv80mG-_W5BytDV5g7d6kW50H-R_2my4=\\r\\nD0W2Yh2G-5_g3wbW4pY-gG3ySGdbf90qqg404\\\" style=3D\\\"color:#00a4bd\\\" data-hs-link=\\r\\n-id=3D\\\"0\\\" data-hs-link-id-v2=3D\\\"52/D0RD1\\\" target=3D\\\"_blank\\\">zero data reten=\\r\\ntion</a>, Kimi K3 is ready for regulated industries like finance and health=\\r\\ncare.</p></div></div></td></tr></tbody></table>\\r\\n  <table role=3D\\\"presentation\\\" cellpadding=3D\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=3D\\\"0\\\" width=3D=\\r\\n\\\"100%\\\" class=3D\\\"\\\" style=3D\\\"\\\"><tbody><tr><td class=3D\\\"hs_padded\\\" style=3D\\\"fo=\\r\\nnt-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:15px; color:#23496d; word-break:brea=\\r\\nk-word; padding:10px 20px\\\"><div id=3D\\\"hs_cos_wrapper_module_178064785038613=\\r\\n\\\" class=3D\\\"hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_module\\\"=\\r\\n style=3D\\\"color: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit;\\\" data-h=\\r\\ns-cos-general-type=3D\\\"widget\\\" data-hs-cos-type=3D\\\"module\\\"><table align=3D\\\"c=\\r\\nenter\\\" border=3D\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=3D\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=3D\\\"0\\\" role=3D\\\"presentatio=\\r\\nn\\\" style=3D\\\"border-collapse:separate!important\\\">\\r\\n    <tbody><tr>\\r\\n      <td align=3D\\\"center\\\" valign=3D\\\"middle\\\" bgcolor=3D\\\"#6825fd\\\" 