ents next week:<=\\r\\n/p>\\r\\n<ul style=3D\\\"line-height:175%\\\">\\r\\n<li><a href=3D\\\"https://d5bPYQ04.na2.hubspotlinks.com/Ctc/ZX+113/d5bPYQ04/VV=\\r\\nzrfQ7m9v6RW4rYWsb1wzfb2W4dVnpw5S8DdfN6crjm-5nXHCW50kH_H6lZ3lXVPGt7S5n5fBXW8=\\r\\n8Z7Z7416frxW6KjvCr3cHXP6W2jz4hG2l1pN5W1HkCSB6cCN_YW49CL138cbpVVW9lTszx3XgVP=\\r\\nGW6pRMpm5fPYv0W5thPTV7lnBGQW1WyqGs3HDqRGN2l5s6dsB6W6W630nnq4lJJn9W4w2mz07Qb=\\r\\nBd_W6ySvsc4ZBskcW7dJ8xc8lC2S2W8Y59t76QShC5W23v_RF56ptVDW7d92HC96-jRDW1qDXzh=\\r\\n7jMhCCW8NsZqB4LHV3mW3TBNz29gLXnxW8rrlw_2P22FsW285Trc1pn14ZW2C8jyS35xtXcW7MT=\\r\\nrHX1H93Q5W5588Bx5cbssvW1s1bNG6F5J5PW47C8-L2H15WwW9lTfmy7PBxgKW7JKtQm6z7B70W=\\r\\n4Jr0XK3GwFGYW2nfxWW22V_VKf3tZyKW04\\\" style=3D\\\"color:#00a4bd\\\" data-hs-link-id=\\r\\n=3D\\\"0\\\" data-hs-link-id-v2=3D\\\"L/fMXfQC\\\" target=3D\\\"_blank\\\">Kimi K3 on Firewor=\\r\\nks</a> =E2=80=94 Tuesday, August 4. Live demo, serverless training walkthro=\\r\\nugh, open Q&amp;A.</li>\\r\\n<li><a href=3D\\\"https://d5bPYQ04.na2.hubspotlinks.com/Ctc/ZX+113/d5bPYQ04/VV=\\r\\nzrfQ7m9v6RW4rYWsb1wzfb2W4dVnpw5S8DdfN6crjq23qn9qW95jsWP6lZ3kxN2zDLFdK546nW5=\\r\\nSX92K1WPT5mW24XXDk1pQ2RJW3fGTSc3swk3GW12NwvG9lrTdDW4RLSQy3HWN8YW6TqWZb1xtYQ=\\r\\n2W3CQrV79klNSPW3NG8pb8sPNSkW3c2Dmd4DqXHgW5P6CPb7sb0wjW65b-kN2RZJ3kVn85s68l_=\\r\\nDSbN4vLcr1HC7bVN49DBD4cwVqTW34GXnC80qnz1V7z72b6KMsRlVxH5Gh8flVfCW2H_4-g1_DB=\\r\\nR1W5kPzh02bVC21W8zwHgf6knhHXW7LWBhs5Q9TtSVXmcz739wPmTW6K2s7_1Why_0W8-Dm3d8z=\\r\\nllKZN7Z_p28yc-YrW70xZX87SrgNxW3pY7tT1HqfNjW3_SG-Y3d41P6W43fqjG4mfsl0f8yVHkF=\\r\\n04\\\" style=3D\\\"color:#00a4bd\\\" data-hs-link-id=3D\\\"0\\\" data-hs-link-id-v2=3D\\\"Ego=\\r\\ng5Kkx\\\" target=3D\\\"_blank\\\">The Real Cost of AI Work with Arize</a> =E2=80=94 =\\r\\nThursday, August 6. 2,400 agent runs, 10 models, what AI work actually cost=\\r\\ns.</li>\\r\\n</ul></div></div></td></tr></tbody></table>\\r\\n  <table role=3D\\\"presentation\\\" cellpadding=3D\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=3D\\\"0\\\" width=3D=\\r\\n\\\"100%\\\" class=3D\\\"\\\" style=3D\\\"\\\"><tbody><tr><td class=3D\\\"hs_padded\\\" style=3D\\\"fo=\\r\\nnt-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:15px; color:#23496d; word-break:brea=\\r\\nk-word; padding:10px 20px\\\"><div id=3D\\\"hs_cos_wrapper_module_17806478503866\\\"=\\r\\n class=3D\\\"hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_module\\\" =\\r\\nstyle=3D\\\"color: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit;\\\" data-hs=\\r\\n-cos-general-type=3D\\\"widget\\\" data-hs-cos-type=3D\\\"module\\\"><table role=3D\\\"non=\\r\\ne\\\" border=3D\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=3D\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=3D\\\"0\\\" style=3D\\\"vertical-align=\\r\\n:top\\\" width=3D\\\"100%\\\">\\r\\n  <tbody><tr>\\r\\n    <td align=3D\\\"center\\\" style=3D\\\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif; color:#234=\\r\\n96d; font-size:0; word-break:break-word\\\">\\r\\n      <p style=3D\\\"font-size:1px;border-top:1px solid #000000;width:50%;marg=\\r\\nin:0 auto;\\\"></p>\\r\\n      <!--[if mso]>\\r\\n        <table role=3D\\\"none\\\" align=3D\\\"center\\\" border=3D\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=3D\\\"0=\\r\\n\\\" cellspacing=3D\\\"0\\\" style=3D\\\"font-size:1px;border-top:1px solid #000000;wid=\\r\\nth:280px;\\\">\\r\\n          <tr>\\r\\n            <td style=3D\\\"height:0;line-height:0\\\">&nbsp;</td>\\r\\n          </tr>\\r\\n        </table>\\r\\n      <![endif]-->\\r\\n    </td>\\r\\n  </tr>\\r\\n</tbody></table></div></td></tr></tbody></table>\\r\\n  <table role=3D\\\"presentation\\\" cellpadding=3D\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=3D\\\"0\\\" width=3D=\\r\\n\\\"100%\\\" class=3D\\\"\\\" style=3D\\\"\\\"><tbody><tr><td class=3D\\\"hs_padded\\\" style=3D\\\"fo=\\r\\nnt-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:15px; color:#23496d; word-break:brea=\\r\\nk-word; padding:10px 20px\\\"><div id=3D\\\"hs_cos_wrapper_module_17806478503867\\\"=\\r\\n class=3D\\\"hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_module\\\" =\\r\\nstyle=3D\\\"color: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit;\\\" data-hs=\\r\\n-cos-general-type=3D\\\"widget\\\" data-hs-cos-type=3D\\\"module\\\"><div id=3D\\\"hs_cos_=\\r\\nwrapper_module_17806478503867_\\\" class=3D\\\"hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widg=\\r\\net hs_cos_wrapper_type_rich_text\\\" style=3D\\\"color: inherit; font-size: inher=\\r\\nit; line-height: inherit;\\\" data-hs-cos-general-type=3D\\\"widget\\\" data-hs-cos-=\\r\\ntype=3D\\\"rich_text\\\"><h3 style=3D\\\"font-size:17px; margin:0; line-height:175%\\\"=\\r\\n><strong>Fireworks Nexus: the intelligent routing layer behind your harness=\\r\\n</strong></h3>\\r\\n<p style=3D\\\"line-height:175%\\\"><a href=3D\\\"https://d5bPYQ04.na2.hubspotlinks.=\\r\\ncom/Ctc/ZX+113/d5bPYQ04/VVzrfQ7m9v6RW4rYWsb1wzfb2W4dVnpw5S8DdfN6crjpM3qn9qW=\\r\\n8wLKSR6lZ3nkN4FrnBrnQJknW2qf2Br6Fsn2HW3yxj7C7m46QvW5Y0mCF7PWJgsW6V1YWL2LCPL=\\r\\nrVdHtLw37hPKYW8R7xjn7-65YNW25bHV0985nS7W5B5gc88BqG6cW3ZKpkb4wgQn5W5FTFBB2df=\\r\\n9hnN7s4dwTtHnWNW88_2vZ3np3L1W54JRzr7qQ_rsW46qvK-89CcpJW8Fj1tb4YyTSjW133dxf8=\\r\\nZSKJFW2K8tWX6tZvNPW2m3CT-5hKp-2W6WWgLC4KhqTrW2sm1nD3tp9Q5N7S86_GL6Fc4W6fLkg=\\r\\nN9frZm_W125KZs5QpdfLW3Gymw173fpdFW5vq9S75rTbt_W2w_VLp74Ft3GW93y7hD5TzXRZf4W=\\r\\nBDdR04\\\" style=3D\\\"color:#00a4bd\\\" data-hs-link-id=3D\\\"0\\\" data-hs-link-id-v2=3D=\\r\\n\\\"3EkosxOc\\\" target=3D\\\"_blank\\\">Fireworks Nexus</a> is now live for all enterp=\\r\\nrises, addressing the shift toward sustainable tokenomics.<span style=3D\\\"wh=\\r\\nite-space-collapse: preserve;\\\"> </span></p>\\r\\n<p style=3D\\\"line-height:175%\\\">&nbsp;</p>\\r\\n<p style=3D\\\"line-height:175%\\\">Nexus is an open-source routing layer that in=\\r\\ntegrates with existing tools to optimize your model usage across tasks. <sp=\\r\\nan style=3D\\\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\"> </span><a href=3D\\\"https://d5b=\\r\\nPYQ04.na2.hubspotlinks.com/Ctc/ZX+113/d5bPYQ04/VVzrfQ7m9v6RW4rYWsb1wzfb2W4d=\\r\\nVnpw5S8DdfN6crjm-5nXHCW50kH_H6lZ3mYW6T00Zd4wRyX4W2M0wbN2sJs6XN1Z1Jwb5NLsYW6=\\r\\nxLqt26WcqjdW2Ppwby2Jcr5wW4gL4K41W-s8tW790Q1V4DXT1VW2s7bYW7bPfNhW207n4y8FQJZ=\\r\\nMW6z0Y2j43RKdDW1XB58X4Lb6JZW3TRf-27LGYG7W4sSjTV1mjBsFVp8bf25MZfmZW8ZbmtG1Jj=\\r\\nfh2W2w2Qgf1tCmYxW8nmm526KCyvKVp3vNb6kBbCBW5Xwv7Q79W3SJW2WmWb32Hk6W-VfjJn06C=\\r\\nlRKDW68B8466YxRhLW2Hlkn-1DdMHxW8kXJvt3_k0b9W1pXTKf6vCR5vW4dmGbg5m-MShW4-mQQ=\\r\\nz4Rh_cSW1jtgWZ3ChBDxN5Qx0x4Xq0nCW7w-m_-7qWfvvW34YR1b7bnHwyW8DGQ9h53sSxtf8Lp=\\r\\nV_g04\\\" style=3D\\\"color:#00a4bd\\\" data-hs-link-id=3D\\\"0\\\" data-hs-link-id-v2=3D\\\"=\\r\\nabtoxabL\\\" target=3D\\\"_blank\\\">FireConnect</a> installs in one command and is =\\r\\nopen source. The Nexus router then intelligently sends routine tasks to K3 =\\r\\nor GLM 5.2 and passes harder tasks through to your closed-source provider (=\\r\\ne.g. Opus 5 or GPT 5.6 sol) using your own key.</p>\\r\\n<p style=3D\\\"line-height:175%\\\">&nbsp;</p>\\r\\n<p style=3D\\\"line-height:175%\\\">The prior month saw a steady stream of resear=\\r\\nch demonstrating the savings and quality gains from routing (see the resear=\\r\\nch from Faros, Arize, and Harvey ICYMI). This week we moved from research i=\\r\\nnto production. Early results from enterprise teams with hundreds of engine=\\r\\ners using Nexus are showing a significant drop in cost per merged PR. If yo=\\r\\nu'd like to trial Fireworks Nexus for your team, we=E2=80=99d love to get i=\\r\\nn touch.</p>\\r\\n<ul style=3D\\\"line-height:175%\\\"></ul></div></div></td></tr></tbody></table>\\r\\n  <table role=3D\\\"presentation\\\" cellpadding=3D\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=3D\\\"0\\\" width=3D=\\r\\n\\\"100%\\\" class=3D\\\"\\\" style=3D\\\"\\\"><tbody><tr><td class=3D\\\"hs_padded\\\" style=3D\\\"fo=\\r\\nnt-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:15px; color:#23496d; word-break:brea=\\r\\nk-word; padding:10px 20px\\\"><div id=3D\\\"hs_cos_wrapper_module_17855380690282\\\"=\\r\\n class=3D\\\"hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_module\\\" =\\r\\nstyle=3D\\\"color: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit;\\\" data-hs=\\r\\n-cos-general-type=3D\\\"widget\\\" data-hs-c