dns/txt; t=1785508730; \\r\\n        x=1785771530;\\r\\nReturn-Path: <1axb827m7zlx93u1xuarxkkkphqe7z5ofyutyg@bf06.eu1.hubspotemail.net>\\r\\nX-HS-Cid: 1axf0tuo4niazqczm5gzwff3o68snbj0k5d6f8\\r\\nList-Unsubscribe: <mailto:1axdagfr80ypo6xuzhlsyzcusyo7q22fddcah0@bf06.eu1.hubspotemail.net?subject=unsubscribe>, <https://hs-26596507.s.hubspotemail-eu1.net/subscription-preferences/v2/unsubscribe-all?data=aM2468cGh0VNW26Fzyz4L97jcW3Rv8Lj25KBqZW4mDCPt5lF2r3TWW3n61z7fJN6xLtby63QFLMlm3MxF64DpW4Rpg213qq8KDN2FRqgpGZzy8W741Vqr88wZCDW11_-xh4xLyncW9bL7T_81y1QTW595wYL7Rgx9GW25cQ1C5SDc4032K82>\\r\\nDate: Fri, 31 Jul 2026 16:38:50 +0200\\r\\nFrom: LocalStack News <news@localstack.cloud>\\r\\nReply-To: news@localstack.cloud\\r\\nTo: iltonwaniawski88@tempmailcf.dpdns.org\\r\\nMessage-ID: <1785508729586.71f9f272-b628-49bb-a2cf-90212dfef0b4@bf06.eu1.hubspotemail.net>\\r\\nSubject: New releases: LocalStack for AWS & Snowflake 2026.07.0\\r\\nMIME-Version: 1.0\\r\\nContent-Type: multipart/alternative; \\r\\n\\tboundary=\\\"----=_Part_2229987_378411171.1785508730553\\\"\\r\\nX-Report-Abuse-To: abuse@hubspot.com (see\\r\\n https://policy.hubspot.com/abuse-complaints)\\r\\nList-Unsubscribe-Post: List-Unsubscribe=One-Click\\r\\nFeedback-ID: aep4b95:aicmw844:aidf:HubSpot\\r\\n\\r\\n------=_Part_2229987_378411171.1785508730553\\r\\nContent-Type: text/plain; charset=utf-8\\r\\nContent-Transfer-Encoding: quoted-printable\\r\\n\\r\\nAWS: Step Functions HTTP Tasks, Aurora DSQL & ECS scheduling. Snowflake: pe=\\r\\nrsistence across restarts and dbt/CTE fixes.\\r\\n\\r\\nWhat=E2=80=99s New in LocalStack Community\\r\\n\\r\\nAugust Edition\\r\\n\\r\\n- LocalStack for AWS 2026.07.0 =E2=80=94 Step Functions HTTP Tasks, Aurora =\\r\\nDSQL, and ECS service scheduling- LocalStack for Snowflake 2026.07.0 =E2=80=\\r\\n=94 persistence across restarts and dbt/CTE SQL compatibility fixes\\r\\n\\r\\nAnnouncing the LocalStack for AWS 2026.07.0 Release\\r\\n\\r\\nLocalStack for AWS 2026.07.0 adds Step Functions HTTP Tasks, Aurora DSQL Cl=\\r\\noudFormation and SQL dialect support, and an ECS service scheduler that mai=\\r\\nntains your desired task count. It also extends the AWS Replicator and brin=\\r\\ngs in-place CloudFormation update support to more than 50 resource types.\\r\\n\\r\\nRead more =E2=86=92 (https://blog.localstack.cloud/localstack-for-aws-relea=\\r\\nse-2026-07-0/?utm_source=3Dhs_email&utm_medium=3Demail&utm_content=3D142159=\\r\\n350&_hsenc=3Dp2ANqtz-95K6q4U0SiR4frB_ppA5_Q3M9n4bMR9NXpIWZDZMUs174Gy_yX7Gab=\\r\\nnP8_ka9ZB1yVKmMBkfE10a_Yn31zNMOWEJLK4jR6vJJTiG-X-LxpvuzmXsU&_hsmi=3D1421593=\\r\\n50 )\\r\\n\\r\\nAnnouncing the LocalStack for Snowflake 2026.07.0 Release\\r\\n\\r\\nLocalStack for Snowflake 2026.07.0 fixes persistence across container resta=\\r\\nrts and aligns DDL transaction behavior with Snowflake. It also improves SQ=\\r\\nL compatibility for dbt workflows, including CTEs, aggregate aliases, UNPIV=\\r\\nOT, QUALIFY, and JavaScript stored procedures.\\r\\n\\r\\nRead more =E2=86=92 (https://blog.localstack.cloud/localstack-for-snowflake=\\r\\n-2026-07-0/?utm_source=3Dhs_email&utm_medium=3Demail&utm_content=3D14215935=\\r\\n0&_hsenc=3Dp2ANqtz-95K6q4U0SiR4frB_ppA5_Q3M9n4bMR9NXpIWZDZMUs174Gy_yX7GabnP=\\r\\n8_ka9ZB1yVKmMBkfE10a_Yn31zNMOWEJLK4jR6vJJTiG-X-LxpvuzmXsU&_hsmi=3D142159350=\\r\\n )\\r\\n\\r\\nAnd of course, the LocalStack blog:\\r\\n\\r\\n- Running LocalStack on Jenkins with Docker-in-Docker\\r\\n\\r\\n- What AWS NYC told us about Agentic AI\\r\\n\\r\\n- Run Airflow DBT pipelines on Snowflake locally with LocalStack\\r\\n\\r\\nTake me to the LocalStack Blog\\r\\n(https://blog.localstack.cloud/?utm_source=3Dhs_email&utm_medium=3Demail&ut=\\r\\nm_content=3D142159350&_hsenc=3Dp2ANqtz-95K6q4U0SiR4frB_ppA5_Q3M9n4bMR9NXpIW=\\r\\nZDZMUs174Gy_yX7GabnP8_ka9ZB1yVKmMBkfE10a_Yn31zNMOWEJLK4jR6vJJTiG-X-LxpvuzmX=\\r\\nsU&_hsmi=3D142159350 )\\r\\n\\r\\nGot something to share? If you've written about LocalStack, built something=\\r\\n awesome, or want to contribute to next week's community spotlight, reply t=\\r\\no this email or reach out on Slack.\\r\\n\\r\\nHappy building! =F0=9F=9A=80\\r\\n\\r\\n=E2=80=94 The LocalStack Team\\r\\n\\r\\nGot a question?\\r\\n\\r\\nSend us a message. (https://www.localstack.cloud/contact?utm_source=3Dhs_em=\\r\\nail&utm_medium=3Demail&utm_content=3D142159350&_hsenc=3Dp2ANqtz-95K6q4U0SiR=\\r\\n4frB_ppA5_Q3M9n4bMR9NXpIWZDZMUs174Gy_yX7GabnP8_ka9ZB1yVKmMBkfE10a_Yn31zNMOW=\\r\\nEJLK4jR6vJJTiG-X-LxpvuzmXsU&_hsmi=3D142159350 )\\r\\n\\r\\n=C2=A9 LocalStack GmbH.\\r\\n\\r\\nAll Rights Reserved.\\r\\n\\r\\ngithub (https://github.com/localstack/localstack?utm_source=3Dhs_email&utm_=\\r\\nmedium=3Demail&utm_content=3D142159350&_hsenc=3Dp2ANqtz-95K6q4U0SiR4frB_ppA=\\r\\n5_Q3M9n4bMR9NXpIWZDZMUs174Gy_yX7GabnP8_ka9ZB1yVKmMBkfE10a_Yn31zNMOWEJLK4jR6=\\r\\nvJJTiG-X-LxpvuzmXsU&_hsmi=3D142159350 )\\r\\n\\r\\nSlack (https://www.localstack.cloud/slack?utm_source=3Dhs_email&utm_medium=\\r\\n=3Demail&utm_content=3D142159350&_hsenc=3Dp2ANqtz-95K6q4U0SiR4frB_ppA5_Q3M9=\\r\\nn4bMR9NXpIWZDZMUs174Gy_yX7GabnP8_ka9ZB1yVKmMBkfE10a_Yn31zNMOWEJLK4jR6vJJTiG=\\r\\n-X-LxpvuzmXsU&_hsmi=3D142159350 )\\r\\n\\r\\nBlueSky (https://bsky.app/profile/localstack.cloud?utm_source=3Dhs_email&ut=\\r\\nm_medium=3Demail&utm_content=3D142159350&_hsenc=3Dp2ANqtz-95K6q4U0SiR4frB_p=\\r\\npA5_Q3M9n4bMR9NXpIWZDZMUs174Gy_yX7GabnP8_ka9ZB1yVKmMBkfE10a_Yn31zNMOWEJLK4j=\\r\\nR6vJJTiG-X-LxpvuzmXsU&_hsmi=3D142159350 )\\r\\n\\r\\nX (https://x.com/localstack?utm_source=3Dhs_email&utm_medium=3Demail&utm_co=\\r\\nntent=3D142159350&_hsenc=3Dp2ANqtz-95K6q4U0SiR4frB_ppA5_Q3M9n4bMR9NXpIWZDZM=\\r\\nUs174Gy_yX7GabnP8_ka9ZB1yVKmMBkfE10a_Yn31zNMOWEJLK4jR6vJJTiG-X-LxpvuzmXsU&_=\\r\\nhsmi=3D142159350 )\\r\\n\\r\\nlinkedin (https://ch.linkedin.com/company/localstack-cloud?utm_source=3Dhs_=\\r\\nemail&utm_medium=3Demail&utm_content=3D142159350&_hsenc=3Dp2ANqtz-95K6q4U0S=\\r\\niR4frB_ppA5_Q3M9n4bMR9NXpIWZDZMUs174Gy_yX7GabnP8_ka9ZB1yVKmMBkfE10a_Yn31zNM=\\r\\nOWEJLK4jR6