7.0 =E2=80=94 Step Functions HTTP Tasks, Aurora=\\r\\n DSQL, and ECS service scheduling</li><li style=3D\\\"font-weight: normal; lin=\\r\\ne-height: 150%;\\\">LocalStack for Snowflake 2026.07.0 =E2=80=94 persistence a=\\r\\ncross restarts and dbt/CTE SQL compatibility fixes</li></ul></div></td></tr=\\r\\n></tbody></table>\\r\\n  <table role=3D\\\"presentation\\\" cellpadding=3D\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=3D\\\"0\\\" width=3D=\\r\\n\\\"100%\\\" class=3D\\\"\\\" style=3D\\\"\\\"><tbody><tr><td class=3D\\\"hs_padded\\\" style=3D\\\"fo=\\r\\nnt-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:16px; color:#464b50; word=\\r\\n-break:break-word; padding:10px 20px\\\"><div id=3D\\\"hs_cos_wrapper_module_1785=\\r\\n4447172282\\\" class=3D\\\"hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_ty=\\r\\npe_module\\\" style=3D\\\"color: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inheri=\\r\\nt;\\\" data-hs-cos-general-type=3D\\\"widget\\\" data-hs-cos-type=3D\\\"module\\\"><div st=\\r\\nyle=3D\\\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;padding:6px 0;\\\"><h2 style=3D\\\"=\\r\\ncolor:#4A25C7; font-size:19px; font-weight:bold; line-height:130%; margin:0=\\r\\n 0 8px\\\">Announcing the LocalStack for AWS 2026.07.0 Release</h2><p style=3D=\\r\\n\\\"color:#2d2d2d;font-size:16px;line-height:150%;margin:0 0 10px;\\\">LocalStack=\\r\\n for AWS 2026.07.0 adds Step Functions HTTP Tasks, Aurora DSQL CloudFormati=\\r\\non and SQL dialect support, and an ECS service scheduler that maintains you=\\r\\nr desired task count. It also extends the AWS Replicator and brings in-plac=\\r\\ne CloudFormation update support to more than 50 resource types.</p><p style=\\r\\n=3D\\\"margin:0;\\\"><a href=3D\\\"https://d36WVX04.eu1.hubspotlinks.com/Ctc/2O+113/=\\r\\nd36WVX04/VWdyGx4bl5jJW6TcYfF1ct9m2W6B8lDm5S7K8YN8SvFG43m2nnW8wLKSR6lZ3ngW2x=\\r\\nrnGq8HhPRgW6Khx5t1-RqlcW51SF0H5J38BnW8TgQM-2LK4LpW2YmK-V24RrHFN7GvVyqxYrZ-W=\\r\\n1hvFry7B40tBW7lszkb7qpvC6W83vBlS6pX60GW2hYzGS6xNGVRW5zRy4k1XtmqJW14-6ZN730p=\\r\\nJ-W3NYdW