KdjjqVDkyLD9fqLqC319Y2>\\r\\nDate: Fri, 31 Jul 2026 00:30:00 -0400\\r\\nFrom: Fireworks AI <product@fireworks.ai>\\r\\nReply-To: marketing@fireworks.ai\\r\\nTo: iltonwaniawski88@tempmailcf.dpdns.org\\r\\nMessage-ID: <1785472200216.3daa55a6-2a01-4959-9e3e-ab0275823115@bf08.na2.hubspotemail.net>\\r\\nSubject: Take Your Model Further: Start Fine-Tuning Today\\r\\nMIME-Version: 1.0\\r\\nContent-Type: multipart/alternative; \\r\\n\\tboundary=\\\"----=_Part_1621528_1224657927.1785472200452\\\"\\r\\nX-Report-Abuse-To: abuse@hubspot.com (see\\r\\n https://policy.hubspot.com/abuse-complaints)\\r\\nList-Unsubscribe-Post: List-Unsubscribe=One-Click\\r\\nFeedback-ID: ae0lywh:aiiy292:aibd7a:HubSpot\\r\\n\\r\\n------=_Part_1621528_1224657927.1785472200452\\r\\nContent-Type: text/plain; charset=utf-8\\r\\nContent-Transfer-Encoding: quoted-printable\\r\\n\\r\\nCustomize your model for faster, smarter results=E2=80=94see how fine-tunin=\\r\\ng works.\\r\\n\\r\\nNow that you know how to deploy and query a model, let=E2=80=99s discuss th=\\r\\ne real power of open models =E2=80=93 customizing them for your data and us=\\r\\ne case.\\r\\n\\r\\nFine-tuning is particularly valuable for tasks like:\\r\\n\\r\\n- Fast, accurate query understanding, summarization, and classification\\r\\n- Cost-effective vision and text processing\\r\\n- Specialized document intelligence\\r\\n- Function calling for agent-driven applications\\r\\n\\r\\nFireworks offers two fine-tuning methods:\\r\\n\\r\\n- Supervised Fine Tuning - trains the model using labeled examples of ideal=\\r\\n outputs\\r\\n- Reinforcement Fine Tuning - optimizes outputs based on an evaluator funct=\\r\\nion that scores model responses\\r\\n\\r\\nLaunch a fine-tuning job (https://d5bPYQ04.na2.hubspotlinks.com/Ctc/ZX+113/=\\r\\nd5bPYQ04/VVRN_m63T9DhN3gRvj34S_-fVNrtzX5S6QdvMVmxWq3lcq-W7Y8-PT6lZ3mCW8KjT5=\\r\\n66J7KlDN1c2DCnqTR-pW5MZJ-Q6xhtbLW2f91vJ8JJfv7W5TKwqD44ncRVW55w1jp5YN0xYW8FK=\\r\\nLfG35wggVN6CW46hYBwP3W3WybN-23bkYtW4NY5zb6gN0h5W5MD-ZP2nQxtHW2yjBKs5BKp-ZW6=\\r\\nyn8Jd464StsW95NQHV3msxpwW2kL9_48rZGP3W7H-LJd2vndnvW7_gV5_5SqPR7N4F8d22XXQRP=\\r\\nVG3Gfk8YJ3SmW5NL7Bx1yJHjmW2v2CtV2ky7p-W74btfX5sFP3nW6Sdd168XhbyZW90dzbM5DGf=\\r\\nxdW9bPcl92pJtHFW4tdLGV5Jfm-jf341jLg04 )\\r\\n\\r\\nWant more free credits?\\r\\n\\r\\nIf you've already used through your first ~1 million free tokens, simply sh=\\r\\noot us a quick reply (mailto:inquiries@fireworks.ai) and let us know a bit =\\r\\nmore about your expected workload and we may be able to offer additional cr=\\r\\nedits. We=E2=80=99d love to learn about your use case and share tailored re=\\r\\ncommendations to help you get the most out of Fireworks.\\r\\n\\r\\nHappy building!\\r\\n\\r\\n- Fireworks Team\\r\\n\\r\\nFireworks.ai, 900 Concar Drive, Floor 5, San Mateo, CA 94402, United States\\r\\n\\r\\nUnsubscribe (https://hs-44215135.s.hubspotemail-na2.net/hs/preferences-cent=\\r\\ner/en/direct?data=3DW2nWGVW47zkgcW3XxKvC3LTh8gW34HkZm3j9Lh6W36dRcC3JRV76W4k=\\r\\nMxKJ47F1CFW2sC0W441SXB1W3BY27W41GwfVW3645Yd30qb_gW3GKpFV4pBn46W3DKG9n4fQSXR=\\r\\nW21mXk82Pv0q0W3dp32b2t53jpW3g9-Lc238VhcW3R3b5s3z9BzPW1Z45vf4cjGwMW2FG34s2F-=\\r\\nB28W32HdKC3XV0dPW3QP6X42KxrdbW257Vnt2-msPTW3KcKr-3XTXZfW3LRdKd36xJkCW4ry_4V=\\r\\n2TpR36W1VwT6F2RPVq4W2sD96k4tfvkSW1S9hv24ff3vHW1LjfCK3_KCqcW1BlHXl3NSlMmW3_V=\\r\\nmD73R38-rW3ZxsQ43zhth4W36y2Ls2zP83nW3H8XWk3QBkwDW3ZKSD53C6W8MW1X9Qsd254YLYW=\\r\\n4twj211BMNhmW3_s0Yj2qG-d1W306P6q4cNxhmW3D-MqB3XH9hsW3JTxYp4hnQDFW2vNQRd2nWC=\\r\\nF4W43R3Fx2qPxWtW3JJRL12FpnkPW3gyBzf348V8SW38rXvk24RSSnW1Vh03y1Lg-xjW2-rktz2=\\r\\nTwgkYW38csn14cg-v1W4kdKN530LMPfW2sVRzJ2YHSvLW2HQJNY3ZDs7PW1St5rB2r84wGW4mnN=\\r\\nkd3BV6zVW4rCWdX1-ZMnnW3BXF6j4kn-vZW2PMZ5Z4hH6QtW4kcTPg45RJf-W3VQnFH3SC0cFW3=\\r\\nVPdTg45BNjTW2sKbSr3NSHGmW4cN_YX21b0YxW2nQzSh43np77W2sMhLz2p8hS5f1ZdTdf04&_h=\\r\\nsenc=3Dp2ANqtz--GYpL-4DM-fc6v7xT9ivCNQZJ5e29uDznJmmAcUWnNmyTbZk-s26LW9V94NL=\\r\\n80hwCyUL9ZOc7TF6bNs1lfejAus0n2E7uF7HIpBtZPC_Kl-1muJWA&_hsmi=3D14594248 )\\r\\nManage preferences (https://hs-44