"100%\\\" cellpadding=3D\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=3D\\\"0\\\">\\r\\n  <tbody>\\r\\n    <tr>\\r\\n      <td class=3D\\\"hs_padded\\\" align=3D\\\"center\\\" valign=3D\\\"top\\\" style=3D\\\"font=\\r\\n-family:Arial, sans-serif; color:#23496d; word-break:break-word; text-align=\\r\\n:center; padding:10px 20px; font-size:0px\\\">\\r\\n        <img alt=3D\\\"\\\" src=3D\\\"https://hs-44215135.f.hubspotemail-na2.net/hub=\\r\\n/44215135/hubfs/fireworks-ai-wordmark-color-dark%20(1)-2.png?width=3D600&am=\\r\\np;upscale=3Dtrue&amp;name=3Dfireworks-ai-wordmark-color-dark%20(1)-2.png\\\" s=\\r\\ntyle=3D\\\"outline:none; text-decoration:none; max-width:100%; font-size:16px\\\"=\\r\\n width=3D\\\"300\\\" align=3D\\\"middle\\\">\\r\\n      </td>\\r\\n    </tr>\\r\\n  </tbody>\\r\\n</table></div>\\r\\n  <table role=3D\\\"presentation\\\" cellpadding=3D\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=3D\\\"0\\\" width=3D=\\r\\n\\\"100%\\\" class=3D\\\"\\\" style=3D\\\"\\\"><tbody><tr><td class=3D\\\"hs_padded\\\" style=3D\\\"fo=\\r\\nnt-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:15px; color:#23496d; word-break:brea=\\r\\nk-word; padding:10px 20px\\\"><div id=3D\\\"hs_cos_wrapper_module_17510609220891\\\"=\\r\\n class=3D\\\"hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_module\\\" =\\r\\nstyle=3D\\\"color: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit;\\\" data-hs=\\r\\n-cos-general-type=3D\\\"widget\\\" data-hs-cos-type=3D\\\"module\\\"><div id=3D\\\"hs_cos_=\\r\\nwrapper_module_17510609220891_\\\" class=3D\\\"hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widg=\\r\\net hs_cos_wrapper_type_rich_text\\\" style=3D\\\"color: inherit; font-size: inher=\\r\\nit; line-height: inherit;\\\" data-hs-cos-general-type=3D\\\"widget\\\" data-hs-cos-=\\r\\ntype=3D\\\"rich_text\\\"><p style=3D\\\"line-height:175%\\\"><span style=3D\\\"color: #000=\\r\\n000;\\\">Now that you know how to deploy and query a model, let=E2=80=99s disc=\\r\\nuss the real power of open models =E2=80=93 <strong>customizing them for yo=\\r\\nur data and use case.</strong></span></p>\\r\\n<p style=3D\\\"line-height:175%\\\">&nbsp;</p>\\r\\n<p style=3D\\\"line-height:175%\\\"><span style=3D\\\"color: #000000;\\\">Fine-tuning i=\\r\\ns particularly valuable for tasks like:</span></p>\\r\\n<ul style=3D\\\"line-height:175%\\\">\\r\\n<li aria-level=3D\\\"1\\\"><span style=3D\\\"color: #000000;\\\">Fast, accurate query u=\\r\\nnderstanding, summarization, and classification</span></li>\\r\\n<li aria-level=3D\\\"1\\\"><span style=3D\\\"color: #000000;\\\">Cost-effective vision =\\r\\nand text processing</span></li>\\r\\n<li aria-level=3D\\\"1\\\"><span style=3D\\\"color: #000000;\\\">Specialized document i=\\r\\nntelligence</span></li>\\r\\n<li aria-level=3D\\\"1\\\"><span style=3D\\\"color: #000000;\\\">Function calling for a=\\r\\ngent-driven applications</span></li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\n<p style=3D\\\"line-height:175%\\\"><span style=3D\\\"color: #000000;\\\">Fireworks off=\\r\\ners two fine-tuning methods:</span></p>\\r\\n<ul style=3D\\\"line-height:175%\\\">\\r\\n<li aria-level=3D\\\"1\\\"><span style=3D\\\"color: #000000;\\\"><strong>Supervised Fin=\\r\\ne Tuning&nbsp;</strong>- trains the model using labeled examples of ideal o=\\r\\nutputs</span></li>\\r\\n<li aria-level=3D\\\"1\\\"><span style=3D\\\"color: #000000;\\\"><strong>Reinforcement =\\r\\nFine Tuning</strong> - optimizes outputs based on an evaluator function tha=\\r\\nt scores model responses</span></li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\n<p style=3D\\\"line-height:175%; font-weight:normal\\\"><span style=3D\\\"color: #00=\\r\\n0000;\\\"><span style=3D\\\"color: #0600ff;\\\"><a href=3D\\\"https://d5bPYQ04.na2.hubs=\\r\\npotlinks.com/Ctc/ZX+113/d5bPYQ04/VVRN_m63T9DhN3gRvj34S_-fVNrtzX5S6QdvMVmxWq=\\r\\n3m2nnW7Y8-PT6lZ3mWW8HX_LC5_JzRFW1TNjCr7whqpTW2s05Vj5cKpvDW15N9qq91RyQmW3-6D=\\r\\n8J4bqRl6W3VVrwP5k-v1MW4XN6pK4GNDmZW6SwhXR5Lzvb0W2WL_9t6lHqRFW6wLC0v8fPK_HW3=\\r\\n1_wFM1Fw-sxW1FfDmC9jl_VRW764CbN5TtmgyVlqHYt4wkh0wW26TyTJ6F2JMDN3P-HWylMwXgW=\\r\\n85hktk8c0w0RW4bgSf24XrmJnW1dZmkM95-YB5W6cNhP