664\\\"\\r\\nX-Report-Abuse-To: abuse@hubspot.com (see\\r\\n https://policy.hubspot.com/abuse-complaints)\\r\\nList-Unsubscribe-Post: List-Unsubscribe=One-Click\\r\\nFeedback-ID: ae0lywh:aiiy291:aibd7a:HubSpot\\r\\n\\r\\n------=_Part_1299333_836823331.1785385805664\\r\\nContent-Type: text/plain; charset=utf-8\\r\\nContent-Transfer-Encoding: quoted-printable\\r\\n\\r\\nUnlock consistent performance, broader model access, and cost-effective ser=\\r\\nving.\\r\\n\\r\\nIn our last guide, we showed you how to query a model serverlessly using th=\\r\\ne API and Model Playground. Now, let=E2=80=99s discuss on-demand deployment=\\r\\ns\\r\\n\\r\\nOn-demand deployments are dedicated GPU clusters reserved for your own use =\\r\\nand billed by the GPU-second. They=E2=80=99re useful if you want:\\r\\n\\r\\n- More predictable performance\\r\\n- No rate limits\\r\\n- Cost-effective serving for high-volume traffic\\r\\n- Access to a larger selection of models\\r\\n\\r\\nAny model from our model library (https://d5bPYQ04.na2.hubspotlinks.com/Ctc=\\r\\n/ZX+113/d5bPYQ04/VW8qs84DFyKQVlW_dh83tnLbW97gBTk5S4GvTN8hWs503pyd0W7Y8-PT6l=\\r\\nZ3pGW4k7Dhw1DnyWVN2VbdVVvgMq5W1Rm3gW2_lm4FW6z3tfP6J_-7hVKTDyf1GBHhCW72c1QM3=\\r\\nv7vy8W2TByqY2MFNXwN42yGDQN9QKjW4x4Pf834q6PQW64GN0t7NyQFlW1TljXN17-j6lW1C1jX=\\r\\nC2WfvW6W4vwXFK1n_s67W3S5Gqx4-sMR-W85pJwN51fHyKW7L0khJ9dc5wbW2JzBGR3BjY0-W5n=\\r\\ny3yB1TbYfvN65jbPph3JfBW2YL9Qq6v0KwlW3K_6hf6tXt17W3pG26Y2VT_8_W7Syz35813KkPW=\\r\\n2f3D2q3Gh9wTW2QwSSD2fKr0yV4DxKg13KTq9d_fQN604 ) can be deployed on-demand.\\r\\n\\r\\nGetting started\\r\\n\\r\\nYou can create an on-demand deployment via:\\r\\n\\r\\n- Our CLI tool firectl (https://d5bPYQ04.na2.hubspotlinks.com/Ctc/ZX+113/d5=\\r\\nbPYQ04/VW8qs84DFyKQVlW_dh83tnLbW97gBTk5S4GvTN8hWs5C3pyd0W95jsWP6lZ3lmW8jlgW=\\r\\nZ7b6zQkW24_BYw5nlS__W5v9Xj96_SS9bW5M5LCB59pzMjW35ywM65F8m61W55rymZ6_-lZ3W4B=\\r\\nsxwD8S2glKW6cHyCK6m7qyTW6Xh2Xy89JfQrN4b4xC7MkvC_W5rCS7-7wFgC7VnjvK160GKGLW6=\\r\\nHMF5436pbm0W7pJlmL2wymxbW4w57nl4KNklNW6j_7-c87b4nPW49YxfM7-RDcZW4Y92_m8bYzV=\\r\\nZW7qBbS_1sHzJrW2_9L7y2Gk2VjW7wRDDb1DzyrYW5QfmFS2_SwnDW3Kdw2l2kg0HRW7KTy-v30=\\r\\nNyRpW6WvmFB1NwT5BW6Bpjh61TnzkpW88Kh3J6TYvgxW70GBs17GxblRW4RG4sP3NVM51W8T1l6=\\r\\nR3d5kDHf3c6LG204 ) (follow the quickstart (https://d5bPYQ04.na2.hubspotlink=\\r\\ns.com/Ctc/ZX+113/d5bPYQ04/VW8qs84DFyKQVlW_dh83tnLbW97gBTk5S4GvTN8hWs5C3pyd0=\\r\\nW95jsWP6lZ3lMW6Qs_Yb3WdJLSW3GV-X45wVcygVB9fD48s0NJ9VmYDPF57lTjQW2Fyc382Zr4p=\\r\\njW5rnSN53KkF6CW6n4GvW1yHbJHW6Vs7z47PkkG-W3Mjgzy60tw15W1_tBW94yjVZgW6z6SHD6K=\\r\\nZ8JDVJ95JM1P-S9wW4jf5ws4WglDZW1VLQ775mKqlqW1qVV2276sQWnW3zCYSJ1BHndhW6Lgdc2=\\r\\n20PcsnW2GNgZq8K46D-W86HR5L956f1rW51L_5w1LZT6nW5YsThk8XG5TyW415z_T8yjChNW3vH=\\r\\nWYk39QZFkW7hKwkf3dYS9cW1MSJVL68vQpJW712jvP8z4S2lW2BNFmb87sfJwW3-ztct1g4vw9V=\\r\\nt7kq84ctF9RW4Kqw6q5Pwcz2f4F1BQv04 ) )\\r\\n- The web UI (https://d5bPYQ04.na2.hubspotlinks.com/Ctc/ZX+113/d5bPYQ04/VW8=\\r\\nqs84DFyKQVlW_dh83tnLbW97gBTk5S4GvTN8hWs5C3pyd0W95jsWP6lZ3k_W8mrShV9cYlY1W3c=\\r\\njdBf863TbYW1sTzFY1lh51yM_7M4yjfvl8W73BV306PPXJXW4PJKdj12YPYRW61TYPc7kvdLnW1=\\r\\n6YYwB6F-RQ8W13MQm64-vdygN2kqRZxcTr0fW77CmYB4p4MtTW5pvHhp6cvbNNW55BYbH4v36nc=\\r\\nW171DD_6mWrW-W22chdQ7LgTdZVSfzL43Ky0zcW3RtWhW2Wzbf3M1NKNwknG8XW2Q9w9L2sL-z-=\\r\\nW71jYMD1nMw2JN4Bs7BlS1ZkSW8yJQF-13X4HpW1PR3YZ78C031W99R_gs2cmfmFW6Dh53C13fb=\\r\\njWW7q5N7f4GQKZKN5r4ZTypQNyDW2vHbKC7p8kdsW4P7qjk4lKNw7W7Yk49P835g09f2p2txn04=\\r\\n )\\r\\n- Our Python build SDK (https://d5bPYQ04.na2.hubspotlinks.com/Ctc/ZX+113/d5=\\r\\nbPYQ04/VW8qs84DFyKQVlW_dh83tnLbW97gBTk5S4GvTN8hWs5C3pyd0W95jsWP6lZ3nzW74l0Y=\\r\\nw1xwp9JW19lH4p5ySsq2N3mqYrgBtrvFW2X-SfF6F1BpcW152Gjh2qSlfbW4q2gn-2RhWrlW1zp=\\r\\nQNf3f5z_yW2m4QcJ6T-JhKW8C5jw09jxp_yW8wKJvK1jwTlbW2MVx_y7-jrFVW8zYPHn1k49cmV=\\r\\nHth2c95g6TvN6HX5TtvrynyW80SQt-2H02gwW90b-rb1nbPzHW5CJjNL3lDS--W7Ddh9q1JxDfb=\\r\\nW7KWqQ26npDksN1r9KtBmBdvzW17ns9T48K12RW1935056hH5hGW23t0c96HGnwjW4ggKl95dg7=\\r\\nXsW49ggKd3q4VhLW2yV19x2VbwBQW3q_1982bGS4QW8M9NQJ6XyTYKW5K958-6d5Qr1W8kgHj54=\\r\\n922MzcMJwv04 )\\r\\n\\r\\nOnce your deployment is provisioned, follow these docs (https://d5bPYQ04.na=\\r\\n2.hubspotlinks.com/Ctc/ZX+113/d5bPYQ04/VW8qs84DFyKQVlW_dh83tnLbW97gBTk5S4Gv=\\r\\nTN8hWs5C3pyd0W95jsWP6lZ3p_W6cYQ6S8CFSBxW1KCgPL2n3TFCW5t_jgj6l5tVtW6YXqY88ph=\\r\\npZmW1m91gr58JqY_W33rTSd3_zbMQW10J6Kg4dnSCgW7RHFbh2yPsc1W796hGn9l-dT7W6hsWTt=\\r\\n7QvBqjW13NVVZ70pN_RW67qjgg2W1zVcVrz6S76gy2kFW3RXsXW7hnL77W5wzxR06LmKpqW3V8V=\\r\\nMS8z3dB2W1PhnC32DJYSfW1cbNQ36CSJ0zW5d3TXY4fkzLcW2RjNJg2ZqMsNVT_W9W44XLKmW8g=\\r\\nL8D-7jr3tqW2tMZfl1zxkmsVx4fSN1zHQ5kW2VxXtf7syww6W8Y6-b_1jlKp6W6vgqQQ3hgV0vN=\\r\\n4SPDYbtnHVXW7q0xrb8PnvbmW8hxQqP8K2dSGf1T-CXb04 ) to query it.\\r\\n\\r\\nWant more free credits?\\r\\n\\r\\nIf you've already used through your first ~1 million free tokens, simply sh=\\r\\noot us a quick reply (mailto:inquiries@fireworks.ai) and let us know a bit =\\r\\nmore about your expected workload and we may be able to offer additional cr=\\r\\nedits. We=E2=80=99d love to learn about your use case and share tailored re=\\r\\ncommendations to help you get the most out of Fireworks.\\r\\n\\r\\nHappy building!\\r\\n\\r\\n- Fireworks Team\\r\\n\\r\\nFireworks.ai, 900 Concar Drive, Floor 5, San Mateo, CA 94402, United States\\r\\n\\r\\nUnsubscribe (https://hs-44215135.s.hubspotemail-na2.net/hs/preferences-cent=\\r\\ner/en/direct?data=3DW2nWGVW47zk56W4th6MP4prVQ1W2zV6K23yZvSvW4p7hs92FRk3gW2s=\\r\\n_zpf4rCt86W2qRd6W2PG3LDW2sNBDf3NRXtYW4tvtbr2-tKQpW3gflPX254YWXW1S4llb24Twzt=\\r\\nW3dglVZ2HFSYkW3QC9Jf47wsMgW41LJq83dsL-yW45Nl3k3K2t4tW45PHv04rDH-wW43FxGF41B=\\r\\nLYSW3SD9Tb4hmv03W2zPD3S1_bFtrW3b98XP2pbqSXW1BdT8Q4crkR1W3R11D02RmZPwW2p4dKk=\\r\\n4kCGbtW3LYyl549lXB8W30yf6z3j8tkgW34vN6T2MpDxYW30LM4p3yWG1LW3jc3533G-wY1W2Wg=\\r\\nYSF1Lpf2LW2t5WYS3ZDTTzW2MTwQ13LXKznW4mc_Dp2RV14dW2nBvWZ24SDLHW2YG6P838wGLyW=\\r\\n2RDc2b2szNLQW3gpBs74p9pGPW49rVrb2w4nvWW4mstHp30qHWdW2-rgYy3d2H53W1N2hcQ1Sz-=\\r\\nVkW2357Qh2RB5NSW47w2Dq3W42x_W3gp_C51L8gbpW3zgFk236gZ87W2-DKjC38wGYhW1LjG6-1=\\r\\nQ6BM8W2xRRM734Dsz8W3gs9N43btM2TW4cL2fl2